#. type: Title ##
#: _docs/All_About_Descriptions_Graphics_and_Screenshots.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Data format"
msgstr "Format data"

#. type: Title ###
#: _docs/All_About_Descriptions_Graphics_and_Screenshots.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Image file formats"
msgstr "Format berkas gambar"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/All_About_Descriptions_Graphics_and_Screenshots.md
msgid "Images may be provided in PNG or JPEG format. They must have the ending `png`, `jpg` or `jpeg`."
msgstr "Gambar mungkin disediakan dalam format PNG atau JPEG. Mereka harus memiliki akhiran `png`, `jpg` atau `jpeg`."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/All_About_Descriptions_Graphics_and_Screenshots.md
msgid "It is important to note that dangerous and unneeded metadata is stripped from image files before they are included in the repo. For example, JPEG EXIF data has [security issues](https://threatpost.com/google-shuts-down-potentially-massive-android-bug/120393/), and it is not needed to display images. This also means that images may be recompressed."
msgstr "Penting untuk dicatat bahwa metadata yang berbahaya dan tidak dibutuhkan dihilangkan dari berkas gambar sebelum dimasukkan dalam repo. Sebagai contoh, data EXIF JPEG memiliki [masalah keamanan](https://threatpost.com/google-shuts-down-potentially-massive-android-bug/120393/), dan tidak dibutuhkan untuk menampilkan gambar. Ini juga berarti bahwa gambar dapat dikompres ulang."

#. type: Title ###
#: _docs/All_About_Descriptions_Graphics_and_Screenshots.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "HTML descriptions"
msgstr "Deskripsi HTML"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/All_About_Descriptions_Graphics_and_Screenshots.md
msgid "The detailed app description may use HTML tags. Note that not all tags are supported by the renderer."
msgstr "Deskripsi aplikasi rinci dapat menggunakan tag HTML. Dicatat bahwa tidak semua tag didukung oleh perender."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/All_About_Descriptions_Graphics_and_Screenshots.md
msgid "These simple layout tags are [supported](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/jekyll-fdroid/-/blob/master/lib/fdroid/Package.rb#L21): `b`, `big`, `blockquote`, `br`, `cite`, `em`, `i`, `li`, `ol`, `small`, `strike`, `strong`, `sub`, `sup`, `tt`, `u`, `ul`."
msgstr "Tag tata letak sederhana berikut [didukung](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/jekyll-fdroid/-/blob/master/lib/fdroid/Package.rb#L21): `b`, `big`, `blockquote`, `br`, `cite`, `em`, `i`, `li`, `ol`, `small`, `strike`, `strong`, `sub`, `sup`, `tt`, `u`, `ul`."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/All_About_Descriptions_Graphics_and_Screenshots.md
msgid "`a` with `href` is currently allowed, but might be removed without notice."
msgstr "`a` dengan `href` saat ini diperbolehkan, tetapi dapat dihapus tanpa pemberitahuan."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/All_About_Descriptions_Graphics_and_Screenshots.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"* Certain tags are explicitly prohibited, namely `applet`, `base`, `body`, `button`, `embed`, `form`, `head`, `html`,\n"
"   `iframe`, `img`, `input`, `link`, `object`, `picture`, `script`, `source`, `style`, `svg` and `video`.\n"
"* Note that a line break will automatically be converted to a `br` tag.\n"
"* You may not make use of JavaScript.\n"
msgstr ""
"* Tag tertentu secara tegas dilarang, yaitu `applet`, `base`, `body`, `button`, `embed`, `form`, `head`, `html`,  \n"
"   `iframe`, `img`, `input`, `link`, `object`, `picture`, `script`, `source`, `style`, `svg`, dan `video`.  \n"
"* Perlu diperhatikan bahwa jeda baris akan secara otomatis diubah menjadi tag `br`.  \n"
"* Anda tidak diperbolehkan menggunakan JavaScript.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: _docs/All_About_Descriptions_Graphics_and_Screenshots.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Ways of providing metadata"
msgstr "Berbagai cara menyediakan metadata"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/All_About_Descriptions_Graphics_and_Screenshots.md
msgid "Adding metadata can be done in the following three ways."
msgstr "Menambahkan metadata dapat dilakukan dengan tiga cara berikut."

#. type: Title ###
#: _docs/All_About_Descriptions_Graphics_and_Screenshots.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "In the application's source repository"
msgstr "Dalam repositori sumber aplikasi"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/All_About_Descriptions_Graphics_and_Screenshots.md
msgid "For the official F-Droid repository, it is **strongly encouraged** to add metadata in the application's source repo for the following reasons:"
msgstr "Untuk repositori F-Droid resmi, **sangat disarankan** untuk menambahkan metadata dalam repo sumber aplikasi dengan alasan berikut:"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/All_About_Descriptions_Graphics_and_Screenshots.md
msgid "The application's metadata is under direct control of the repository owners"
msgstr "Metadata aplikasi di bawah kendali langsung dari pemilik repositori"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/All_About_Descriptions_Graphics_and_Screenshots.md
msgid "Metadata from the repository is copied to the F-Droid repo automatically (thus no merge requests are needed)"
msgstr "Metadata dari repositori disalin ke repo F-Droid secara otomatis (jadi tidak memerlukan permintaan gabungan)"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/All_About_Descriptions_Graphics_and_Screenshots.md
msgid "It is the only way to provide images, such as the app icon or screenshots"
msgstr "Ini adalah satu-satunya cara untuk menyediakan gambar, seperti ikon aplikasi atau tangkapan layar"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/All_About_Descriptions_Graphics_and_Screenshots.md
msgid "F-Droid supports two distinct file structures. These aim to be compatible with existing free software tools that allow publishing applications to Google Play. It is not required to install any of these tools, the file structure can easily be created manually instead."
msgstr "F-Droid mendukung dua struktur berkas berbeda. Mereka disasarkan untuk menjadi kompatibel dengan alat-alat perangkat lunak bebas yang memperbolehkan publikasi aplikasi ke Google Play. Ini tidak dibutuhkan untuk menginstal alat-alat ini, struktur berkas dapat dibuat secara manual."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/All_About_Descriptions_Graphics_and_Screenshots.md
msgid "Please be aware that texts in the app's metadata file will override all other descriptive texts provided through the structures explained below. This affects [_Name_](../Build_Metadata_Reference/#Name), [_Summary_](../Build_Metadata_Reference/#Summary), and [_Description_](../Build_Metadata_Reference/#Description).  Once metadata fields that were previously in the metadata file have been moved to the app's source repo, please file a [merge request](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroiddata/merge_requests) or [issue](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroiddata/issues) to remove _Summary_ and _Description_ from the app's metadata file."
msgstr "Harap diperhatikan bahwa teks dalam berkas metadata aplikasi akan menimpa semua teks deskriptif lain yang disediakan melalui struktur yang dijelaskan di bawah ini. Hal ini memengaruhi [_Name_](../Build_Metadata_Reference/#Name), [_Summary_](../Build_Metadata_Reference/#Summary), dan [_Description_](../Build_Metadata_Reference/#Description). Setelah bidang metadata yang sebelumnya ada dalam berkas metadata dipindahkan ke repositori sumber aplikasi, harap ajukan [permintaan penggabungan](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroiddata/merge_requests) atau [isu](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroiddata/issues) untuk menghapus _Summary_ dan _Description_ dari berkas metadata aplikasi."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/All_About_Descriptions_Graphics_and_Screenshots.md
msgid "For more details, see the [precedence rules](#precedence) described at the end of this file."
msgstr "Untuk detail lebih lanjut, lihat [aturan prioritas](#precedence) yang dijelaskan di akhir berkas ini."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/All_About_Descriptions_Graphics_and_Screenshots.md
msgid "F-Droid will only use metadata files from the latest release. This means that *fdroidserver* will check out the latest version it knows and scan the repository at the state of that version for metadata files."
msgstr "F-Droid hanya akan menggunakan berkas metadata dari rilis terbaru. Ini berarti *fdroidserver* akan mengambil versi terbaru yang diketahui dan memindai repositori pada keadaan versi tersebut untuk mencari berkas metadata."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/All_About_Descriptions_Graphics_and_Screenshots.md
msgid "All metadata files are completely optional, except for the short summary description as well as the longer full description. However, apps which do not fulfill certain [criteria](#latest-tab-criteria) will not be shown on the Latest tab."
msgstr "Semua berkas metadata sepenuhnya bersifat opsional, kecuali untuk deskripsi singkat serta deskripsi panjang penuh. Namun, aplikasi yang tidak memenuhi [kriteria](#latest-tab-criteria) tertentu tidak akan ditampilkan pada tab “Terbaru”."

#. type: Title ####
#: _docs/All_About_Descriptions_Graphics_and_Screenshots.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Fastlane structure"
msgstr "Struktur Fastlane"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/All_About_Descriptions_Graphics_and_Screenshots.md
msgid "The first of the two structures is aiming to be compatible to the [fastlane supply](https://github.com/fastlane/fastlane/blob/2.28.7/supply/README.md#images-and-screenshots) tool."
msgstr "Struktur pertama dari dua struktur ini ditujukan agar kompatibel dengan alat [fastlane supply](https://github.com/fastlane/fastlane/blob/2.28.7/supply/README.md#images-and-screenshots)."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/All_About_Descriptions_Graphics_and_Screenshots.md
msgid "The basic file structure is as follows. Pay attention to the notes at the right. When this structure is created, it needs to be place in the correct position as outlined below."
msgstr "Struktur berkas dasarnya adalah sebagai berikut. Perhatikan catatan di sebelah kanan. Ketika struktur ini dibuat, harus ditempatkan pada posisi yang benar seperti dijelaskan di bawah ini."

#. type: Fenced code block
#: _docs/All_About_Descriptions_Graphics_and_Screenshots.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"├── en-US                       (en-US is the F-Droid fallback language)\n"
"│   ├── short_description.txt   (short description, max 80 chars, mandatory)\n"
"│   ├── full_description.txt    (full app description, max 4000 chars, mandatory)\n"
"│   ├── title.txt               (app name, max 50 chars)\n"
"│   ├── video.txt               (URL to a video introducing the app)\n"
"│   ├── images\n"
"│   │   ├── icon.png            (app icon)\n"
"│   │   ├── featureGraphic.png  (promo banner, shown on top of the app desc in F-Droid client; landscape)\n"
"│   │   ├── tvBanner.png        (\"icon\" for TV devices, currently not used)\n"
"│   │   ├── phoneScreenshots\n"
"│   │   │   ├── 1.png\n"
"│   │   │   ├── 2.png\n"
"│   │   │   ...\n"
"│   │   ├── sevenInchScreenshots/\n"
"│   │   ├── tenInchScreenshots/ (you may add different screenshots for different screen sizes)\n"
"│   │   ├── tvScreenshots/\n"
"│   │   └── wearScreenshots/\n"
"│   └── changelogs\n"
"│       ├── 100000.txt          (must correspond to versionCode, literally, no padding)\n"
"│       ├── 100100.txt          (if the version code was set to 100100)\n"
"│       └── 100101.txt          (max 500 chars)\n"
"└── ru                          (other locale codes)\n"
"    ...                         (localized metadata is always preferred by the client)\n"
"    └── changelogs\n"
"        └── 100100.txt\n"
msgstr ""
"├── en-US                       (en-US adalah bahasa cadangan F-Droid)\n"
"│   ├── short_description.txt   (deskripsi singkat, maksimal 80 karakter, wajib)\n"
"│   ├── full_description.txt    (deskripsi lengkap aplikasi, maksimal 4000 karakter, wajib)\n"
"│   ├── title.txt               (nama aplikasi, maksimal 50 karakter)\n"
"│   ├── video.txt               (URL video pengenalan aplikasi)\n"
"│   ├── images\n"
"│   │   ├── icon.png            (ikon aplikasi)\n"
"│   │   ├── featureGraphic.png  (banner promosi, ditampilkan di atas deskripsi aplikasi di klien F-Droid; orientasi landscape)\n"
"│   │   ├── tvBanner.png        (“ikon” untuk perangkat TV, saat ini tidak digunakan)\n"
"│   │   ├── phoneScreenshots\n"
"│   │   │   ├── 1.png\n"
"│   │   │   ├── 2.png\n"
"│   │   │   ...\n"
"│   │   ├── sevenInchScreenshots/\n"
"│   │   ├── tenInchScreenshots/ (Anda dapat menambahkan screenshot berbeda untuk ukuran layar yang berbeda)\n"
"│   │   ├── tvScreenshots/\n"
"│   │   └── wearScreenshots/\n"
"│   └── changelogs\n"
"│       ├── 100000.txt          (harus sesuai dengan versionCode, secara harfiah, tanpa spasi tambahan)\n"
"│       ├── 100100.txt          (jika kode versi ditetapkan menjadi 100100)\n"
"│       └── 100101.txt          (maksimal 500 karakter)\n"
"└── ru                          (kode lokalisasi lainnya)\n"
"    ...                         (metadata yang dilokalkan selalu diutamakan oleh klien)\n"
"    └── changelogs\n"
"        └── 100100.txt\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/All_About_Descriptions_Graphics_and_Screenshots.md
msgid "This structure should be placed at one of the following locations from **the repository's root**:"
msgstr "Struktur ini harus dipasang di salah satu lokasi dari **root repositori**:"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/All_About_Descriptions_Graphics_and_Screenshots.md
msgid "`metadata/<locale>/`"
msgstr "`metadata/<locale>/`"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/All_About_Descriptions_Graphics_and_Screenshots.md
msgid "`fastlane/metadata/android/<locale>/`"
msgstr "`fastlane/metadata/android/<locale>/`"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/All_About_Descriptions_Graphics_and_Screenshots.md
msgid "Alternatively, if a Gradle build flavor is specified in the Build Metadata, the following location is also supported:"
msgstr "Sebagai alternatif, jika jenis build Gradle ditentukan dalam Metadata Build, lokasi berikut juga didukung:"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/All_About_Descriptions_Graphics_and_Screenshots.md
msgid "`src/<buildFlavor>/fastlane/metadata/android/<locale>/`"
msgstr "`src/<buildFlavor>/fastlane/metadata/android/<locale>/`"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/All_About_Descriptions_Graphics_and_Screenshots.md
msgid "Or if the sub-directory is specified in the Build Metadata, the following location is also supported:"
msgstr "Atau jika direktori turunan ditentukan dalam Metadata Build, lokasi berikut juga didukung:"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/All_About_Descriptions_Graphics_and_Screenshots.md
msgid "`<subdir>/fastlane/metadata/android/<locale>/`"
msgstr "`<subdir>/fastlane/metadata/android/<locale>/`"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/All_About_Descriptions_Graphics_and_Screenshots.md
msgid "(Some use cases of **build flavors** and multiple apps inside one repository are currently not properly supported. Follow [this issue](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidserver/issues/829) tracking the implementation of this.)"
msgstr "(Beberapa kasus penggunaan **build flavors** dan beberapa aplikasi dalam satu repositori saat ini belum didukung dengan baik. Ikuti [masalah ini](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidserver/issues/829) yang melacak implementasi fitur ini.)"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/All_About_Descriptions_Graphics_and_Screenshots.md
msgid "Note that placing the structure anywhere else, like in the gradle module's root, **won't work**."
msgstr "Perlu diketahui bahwa menempatkan struktur di tempat lain, misalnya di root modul gradle, **tidak akan berfungsi**."

#. type: Title ####
#: _docs/All_About_Descriptions_Graphics_and_Screenshots.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Triple-T structure"
msgstr "Struktur Triple-T"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/All_About_Descriptions_Graphics_and_Screenshots.md
msgid "The second supported structure is compatible with the tool [Triple-T Gradle Play Publisher](https://github.com/Triple-T/gradle-play-publisher/blob/2.8.0/README.md#publishing-listings)."
msgstr "Struktur kedua yang didukung kompatibel dengan alat [Triple-T Gradle Play Publisher](https://github.com/Triple-T/gradle-play-publisher/blob/2.8.0/README.md#publishing-listings)."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/All_About_Descriptions_Graphics_and_Screenshots.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Place the following structure at `<module>/src/main/play/` or, for **build flavor** support, at `<module>/src/<buildFlavor>/play/`, where `<module>` is the gradle module of your app (in many cases, this is just the folder `app`):\n"
msgstr "Tempatkan struktur berikut di `<module>/src/main/play/` atau, untuk dukungan **build flavor**, di `<module>/src/<buildFlavor>/play/`, di mana `<module>` adalah modul gradle aplikasi Anda (dalam banyak kasus, ini hanyalah folder `app`):\n"

#. type: Fenced code block
#: _docs/All_About_Descriptions_Graphics_and_Screenshots.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"├── contact-email.txt                   (Developer email / AuthorEmail)\n"
"├── contact-website.txt                 (Developer website / AuthorWebSite)\n"
"├── release-notes\n"
"│   └── en-US\n"
"│       └── default.txt                 (latest changelog)\n"
"└── listings\n"
"    ├── en-US                           (en-US is the default locale in F-Droid)\n"
"    │   ├── title.txt                   (app name, max 50 chars)\n"
"    │   ├── short-description.txt       (short description, max 80 chars, mandatory)\n"
"    │   ├── full-description.txt        (full app description, max 4000 chars, mandatory)\n"
"    │   ├── video-url.txt               (URL to a video introducing the app)\n"
"    │   ├── whatsnew                    (alternative changelog location; single file, no .txt)\n"
"    │   └── graphics\n"
"    │       ├── icon                    (app icon)\n"
"    │       │   └── *.(png|jpg)         1 image, usually 512x512\n"
"    │       ├── feature-graphic         (promo banner, shown on top of the app desc in F-Droid client)\n"
"    │       │   └── *.(png|jpg)         1 image, usually 1024x500\n"
"    │       ├── phone-screenshots\n"
"    │       │   └── *.(png|jpg)\n"
"    │       ├── tablet-screenshots\n"
"    │       │   └── *.(png|jpg)\n"
"    │       ├── large-tablet-screenshots\n"
"    │       │   └── *.(png|jpg)\n"
"    │       ├── tv-banner               (\"icon\" for TV devices, currently not used)\n"
"    │       │   └── *.(png|jpg)\n"
"    │       ├── tv-screenshots\n"
"    │       │   └── *.(png|jpg)\n"
"    │       └── wear-screenshots\n"
"    │           └── *.(png|jpg)\n"
"    ├── de                              (other locales)\n"
"        ├── ...\n"
msgstr ""
"├── contact-email.txt                   (Email pengembang / AuthorEmail)  \n"
"├── contact-website.txt                 (Situs web pengembang / AuthorWebSite)  \n"
"├── release-notes  \n"
"│   └── en-US  \n"
"│       └── default.txt                 (catatan perubahan terbaru)  \n"
"└── listings  \n"
"    ├── en-US                           (en-US adalah lokal default di F-Droid)  \n"
"    │   ├── title.txt                   (nama aplikasi, maks. 50 karakter)  \n"
"    │   ├── short-description.txt       (deskripsi singkat, maks. 80 karakter, wajib)  \n"
"    │   ├── full-description.txt        (deskripsi lengkap aplikasi, maks. 4000 karakter, wajib)  \n"
"    │   ├── video-url.txt               (tautan ke video pengantar aplikasi)  \n"
"    │   ├── whatsnew                    (lokasi alternatif untuk catatan perubahan; satu berkas, tanpa .txt)  \n"
"    │   └── graphics  \n"
"    │       ├── icon                    (ikon aplikasi)  \n"
"    │       │   └── *.(png|jpg)         1 gambar, biasanya 512x512  \n"
"    │       ├── feature-graphic         (spanduk promosi, ditampilkan di bagian atas deskripsi aplikasi di klien F-Droid)  \n"
"    │       │   └── *.(png|jpg)         1 gambar, biasanya 1024x500  \n"
"    │       ├── phone-screenshots  \n"
"    │       │   └── *.(png|jpg)  \n"
"    │       ├── tablet-screenshots  \n"
"    │       │   └── *.(png|jpg)  \n"
"    │       ├── large-tablet-screenshots  \n"
"    │       │   └── *.(png|jpg)  \n"
"    │       ├── tv-banner               (“ikon” untuk perangkat TV, saat ini tidak digunakan)  \n"
"    │       │   └── *.(png|jpg)  \n"
"    │       ├── tv-screenshots  \n"
"    │       │   └── *.(png|jpg)  \n"
"    │       └── wear-screenshots  \n"
"    │           └── *.(png|jpg)  \n"
"    ├── de                              (lokal lain)  \n"
"        ├── ...\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: _docs/All_About_Descriptions_Graphics_and_Screenshots.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "In the app's build metadata in an *fdroiddata* collection"
msgstr "Dalam metadata pembangunan aplikasi di koleksi *fdroiddata*"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/All_About_Descriptions_Graphics_and_Screenshots.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Note**: This option is only meant for those who host their own repositories. If you are a developer who wants to get\n"
"an app into the main F-Droid repository, **do not choose this option**. Specifically, screenshots may not be added to\n"
"the *fdroiddata* repository.\n"
msgstr "**Catatan**: Opsi ini hanya ditujukan bagi mereka yang mengelola repositori sendiri. Jika Anda adalah pengembang yang ingin menambahkan aplikasi ke repositori utama F-Droid, **jangan pilih opsi ini**. Secara khusus, tangkapan layar tidak boleh ditambahkan ke repositori *fdroiddata*.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/All_About_Descriptions_Graphics_and_Screenshots.md
msgid "Metadata files can also be added to any *fdroiddata* repository of build metadata. The file structure is modelled after fastlane as well and it looks the same as shown above, with the following additional notes."
msgstr "Berkas metadata juga dapat ditambahkan ke repositori *fdroiddata* mana pun yang berisi metadata pembangunan. Struktur berkasnya mengikuti model fastlane dan terlihat sama seperti ditunjukkan di atas, dengan catatan tambahan berikut."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/All_About_Descriptions_Graphics_and_Screenshots.md
msgid "Place the structure in the following location: `<fdroiddata>/metadata/<packageId>/`"
msgstr "Tempatkan struktur di lokasi berikut: `<fdroiddata>/metadata/<packageId>/`"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/All_About_Descriptions_Graphics_and_Screenshots.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   * For example, for `en-US`, `title.txt` would reside in this location:\n"
"   `<fdroiddata>/metadata/<packageId>/en-US/title.txt`\n"
"* Instead of `short_description.txt`, the summary file should be named `summary.txt`.\n"
"* Instead of `full_description.txt`, the description file should be named `description.txt`.\n"
"* Not following the above two points causes the linter to fail.\n"
msgstr ""
"   * Sebagai contoh, untuk `en-US`, file `title.txt` akan berada di lokasi berikut:\n"
"   `<fdroiddata>/metadata/<packageId>/en-US/title.txt`\n"
"* Alih-alih `short_description.txt`, file ringkasan harus dinamai `summary.txt`.\n"
"* Alih-alih `full_description.txt`, file deskripsi harus dinamai `description.txt`.\n"
"* Tidak mengikuti dua poin di atas akan menyebabkan linter gagal.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: _docs/All_About_Descriptions_Graphics_and_Screenshots.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "In the F-Droid repo"
msgstr "Di repositori F-Droid"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/All_About_Descriptions_Graphics_and_Screenshots.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Note**: This option is only available to those who host their own repositories.\n"
msgstr "**Catatan**: Opsi ini hanya tersedia bagi mereka yang mengelola repositori sendiri.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/All_About_Descriptions_Graphics_and_Screenshots.md
msgid "The ultimate destination for files from the app's source repo and *fdroiddata* metadata sub-directories is in the F-Droid repo. The text all gets included into the index file (aka *index-v1.json*). All of the graphics files can be directly included in the repo."
msgstr "Tujuan akhir untuk berkas dari repositori sumber aplikasi dan subdirektori metadata *fdroiddata* adalah di repositori F-Droid. Semua teks disertakan ke dalam berkas indeks (*(index-v1.json)*). Semua berkas grafik dapat langsung dimasukkan ke dalam repositori."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/All_About_Descriptions_Graphics_and_Screenshots.md
msgid "If graphics files are also in the app's source or *fdroiddata*, then the files directly in the repo will be overwritten."
msgstr "Jika berkas grafik juga ada di sumber aplikasi atau *fdroiddata*, maka berkas yang ada langsung di repositori akan ditimpa."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/All_About_Descriptions_Graphics_and_Screenshots.md
msgid "You may not place text files directly in the repo."
msgstr "Anda tidak boleh menempatkan berkas teks langsung di repositori."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/All_About_Descriptions_Graphics_and_Screenshots.md
msgid "For reference, picture files can be placed in the repo at the following locations:"
msgstr "Sebagai acuan, berkas gambar dapat ditempatkan di repositori pada lokasi berikut:"

#. type: Fenced code block
#: _docs/All_About_Descriptions_Graphics_and_Screenshots.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"- fdroid\n"
"  └── repo\n"
"      └── <package-id>\n"
"          └── <locale>\n"
"              ├── featureGraphic.png\n"
"              ├── icon.png\n"
"              ├── tvBanner.png\n"
"              ├── phoneScreenshots\n"
"              │   └── *.png\n"
"              ├── sevenInchScreenshots\n"
"              │   └── *.png\n"
"              ├── tenInchScreenshots\n"
"              │   └── *.png\n"
"              ├── tvScreenshots\n"
"              │   └── *.png\n"
"              └── wearScreenshots\n"
"                  └── *.png\n"
msgstr ""
"```\n"
"- fdroid\n"
"  └── repo\n"
"      └── <package-id>\n"
"          └── <locale>\n"
"              ├── featureGraphic.png\n"
"              ├── icon.png\n"
"              ├── tvBanner.png\n"
"              ├── phoneScreenshots\n"
"              │   └── *.png\n"
"              ├── sevenInchScreenshots\n"
"              │   └── *.png\n"
"              ├── tenInchScreenshots\n"
"              │   └── *.png\n"
"              ├── tvScreenshots\n"
"              │   └── *.png\n"
"              └── wearScreenshots\n"
"                  └── *.png\n"
"```\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: _docs/All_About_Descriptions_Graphics_and_Screenshots.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Precedence"
msgstr "Prioritas"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/All_About_Descriptions_Graphics_and_Screenshots.md
msgid "The following general precedence rules are applied when multiple of the above options provide metadata:"
msgstr "Aturan prioritas umum berikut diterapkan ketika ada beberapa opsi di atas yang menyediakan metadata:"

