msgid "The project's Open Collective (<https://opencollective.com>) user or group name, if it has one. This should be an alphanumeric name, such that (for example) <https://opencollective.com/xxxxx> redirects to your account page."
msgstr "Nama pengguna atau grup proyek di Open Collective (https://opencollective.com), jika ada. Nama ini harus berupa alfanumerik, misalnya [https://opencollective.com/xxxxx](https://opencollective.com/xxxxx) yang mengarahkan ke halaman akun Anda."

