#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/FAQ_-_Client.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "</dt><dd><tt><a href=\"https://developer.android.com/reference/android/Manifest.permission.html#WRITE_SETTINGS\" target=\"_blank\">android.permission.WRITE_SETTINGS</a></tt></dd><dt>\n"
msgstr "</dt><dd><tt><a href=\"https://developer.android.com/reference/android/Manifest.permission.html#WRITE_SETTINGS\" target=\"_blank\">android.permission.WRITE_SETTINGS</a></tt></dd><dt>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/FAQ_-_Client.md
msgid "Allows the nearby service to stay running as long as the user leaves it running:"
msgstr "Memungkinkan layanan *Nearby* tetap berjalan selama pengguna tidak menghentikannya:"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/FAQ_-_Client.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "</dt><dd><tt><a href=\"https://developer.android.com/reference/android/Manifest.permission.html#WAKE_LOCK\" target=\"_blank\">android.permission.WAKE_LOCK</a></tt></dd><dt>\n"
msgstr "</dt><dd><tt><a href=\"https://developer.android.com/reference/android/Manifest.permission.html#WAKE_LOCK\" target=\"_blank\">android.permission.WAKE_LOCK</a></tt></dd><dt>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/FAQ_-_Client.md
msgid "Find and use compatible repositories and mirrors on external storage:"
msgstr "Mencari dan menggunakan repositori serta *mirror* kompatibel di penyimpanan eksternal:"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/FAQ_-_Client.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"</dt><dd><tt><a href=\"https://developer.android.com/reference/android/Manifest.permission.html#READ_EXTERNAL_STORAGE\" target=\"_blank\">android.permission.READ_EXTERNAL_STORAGE</a></tt><br/>\n"
"<tt><a href=\"https://developer.android.com/reference/android/Manifest.permission.html#MANAGE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE\" target=\"_blank\">android.permission.MANAGE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE</a></tt></dd><dt>\n"
msgstr ""
"</dt><dd><tt><a href=\"https://developer.android.com/reference/android/Manifest.permission.html#READ_EXTERNAL_STORAGE\" target=\"_blank\">android.permission.READ_EXTERNAL_STORAGE</a></tt><br/>\n"
"<tt><a href=\"https://developer.android.com/reference/android/Manifest.permission.html#MANAGE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE\" target=\"_blank\">android.permission.MANAGE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE</a></tt></dd><dt>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/FAQ_-_Client.md
msgid "Detect when a USB thumb drive has been inserted, so it can be scanned to find compatible repositories and mirrors:"
msgstr "Mendeteksi ketika USB flash drive dicolokkan sehingga dapat dipindai untuk menemukan repositori dan *mirror* yang kompatibel:"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/FAQ_-_Client.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "</dt><dd><tt><a href=\"https://developer.android.com/reference/android/Manifest.permission.html#USB_PERMISSION\" target=\"_blank\">android.permission.USB_PERMISSION</a></tt></dd><dt>\n"
msgstr "</dt><dd><tt><a href=\"https://developer.android.com/reference/android/Manifest.permission.html#USB_PERMISSION\" target=\"_blank\">android.permission.USB_PERMISSION</a></tt></dd><dt>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/FAQ_-_Client.md
msgid "Temporarily store and use downloaded files on external storage:"
msgstr "Menyimpan sementara dan menggunakan berkas yang diunduh di penyimpanan eksternal:"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/FAQ_-_Client.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "</dt><dd><tt><a href=\"https://developer.android.com/reference/android/Manifest.permission.html#WRITE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE\" target=\"_blank\">android.permission.WRITE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE</a></tt></dd></dl>\n"
msgstr "</dt><dd><tt><a href=\"https://developer.android.com/reference/android/Manifest.permission.html#WRITE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE\" target=\"_blank\">android.permission.WRITE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE</a></tt></dd></dl>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/FAQ_-_Client.md
msgid "F-Droid [Privileged Extension](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/privileged-extension/) is also relevant here, although it falls outside of the Android system of declaring permissions. Privileged Extension is installed with [`priv-app`](https://source.android.com/docs/core/permissions/perms-allowlist) permissions, which gives F-Droid system-level access privileges to Android. The use of Privileged Extension improves security by allowing automatic app updates as well as letting the user leave the \"Unknown Sources\" setting off. Privileged Extension is designed on the principals of \"least privilege\", so that elevated powers are only granted where they are absolutely needed, and those powers are limited as much as possible.  In order to make it possible outside reviewers to confirm that, we have made Privileged Extension as simple and small as possible."
msgstr ""
"[F-Droid Privileged Extension](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/privileged-extension/) juga relevan di sini, meskipun tidak termasuk dalam sistem perizinan Android biasa. *Privileged Extension* dipasang dengan izin [`priv-app`](https://source.android.com/docs/core/permissions/perms-allowlist), yang memberikan F-Droid hak akses tingkat sistem pada Android. Penggunaan ekstensi ini meningkatkan keamanan dengan memungkinkan pembaruan aplikasi otomatis dan membuat pengguna dapat tetap menonaktifkan opsi “Unknown Sources”.  \n"
"\n"
"*Privileged Extension* dirancang berdasarkan prinsip *least privilege* (hak istimewa minimal), yang berarti hak akses tambahan hanya diberikan bila benar-benar diperlukan dan dibatasi seminimal mungkin. Untuk memudahkan peninjauan pihak luar, kami membuat *Privileged Extension* sekecil dan sesederhana mungkin."

#. type: Title ###
#: _docs/FAQ_-_Client.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "What is expert mode?"
msgstr "Apa itu *Expert Mode*?"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/FAQ_-_Client.md
msgid "Enabling the 'Expert Mode' setting in Preferences will make the client display additional information which is probably not useful to most people. This includes things like package IDs and signature hashes. Some extra configuration options also appear."
msgstr "Mengaktifkan opsi “Expert Mode” di *Preferences* akan membuat aplikasi klien menampilkan informasi tambahan yang biasanya tidak berguna bagi kebanyakan pengguna, seperti ID paket dan hash tanda tangan. Beberapa opsi konfigurasi tambahan juga akan muncul."

#. type: Title ###
#: _docs/FAQ_-_Client.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "I can download apps, but then \"Install\" is disabled. Why?"
msgstr "Saya bisa mengunduh aplikasi, tetapi tombol “Install” tidak aktif. Mengapa?"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/FAQ_-_Client.md
msgid "Some users have apps such as Twilight installed, which draw directly to the screen regardless of what app is shown. For security reasons, Android wisely doesn't allow apps to be installed when such apps are running. If it did, then people could create apps that draw a fake \"Install\" button over the top of the real one, resulting in users installing unwanted apps. The solution is to disable such apps before installing via F-Droid."
msgstr "Beberapa pengguna memiliki aplikasi seperti Twilight yang menggambar lapisan di atas layar. Demi keamanan, Android tidak mengizinkan instalasi aplikasi saat aplikasi semacam ini aktif. Jika hal tersebut diperbolehkan, pengembang berbahaya bisa membuat aplikasi yang menampilkan tombol “Install” palsu di atas tombol sebenarnya, menyebabkan pengguna memasang aplikasi yang tidak diinginkan. Solusinya adalah menonaktifkan aplikasi seperti itu sebelum memasang aplikasi melalui F-Droid."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/FAQ_-_Client.md
msgid "See [Issue 151](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidclient/issues/151) or [this Google+ comment](https://plus.google.com/116713673773180618201/posts/UvW3tgSgdUp)  for more details."
msgstr "Lihat [Isu 151](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidclient/issues/151) atau [komentar di Google+ ini](https://plus.google.com/116713673773180618201/posts/UvW3tgSgdUp) untuk detail lebih lanjut."

#. type: Title ###
#: _docs/FAQ_-_Client.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Why doesn't the client show the number of installs/downloads for each app?"
msgstr "Mengapa klien tidak menampilkan jumlah instalasi atau unduhan untuk setiap aplikasi?"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/FAQ_-_Client.md
msgid "To show how many people had installed an app, we would have to be spying on them - in other words, keeping track of what apps people install and uninstall on their devices, and sending that data back to ourselves. We don't do that, and we're not going to do it."
msgstr "Untuk menampilkan berapa banyak pengguna yang memasang aplikasi, kami harus memantau mereka — dengan kata lain, melacak aplikasi apa yang diinstal dan dicopot dari perangkat, lalu mengirimkan data itu kembali ke kami. Kami **tidak melakukannya**, dan tidak akan pernah melakukannya."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/FAQ_-_Client.md
msgid "Theoretically, the number of downloads is available via our web server logs. However, this would be a meaningless figure because:"
msgstr "Secara teori, jumlah unduhan dapat dilihat dari log server web kami. Namun, angka itu tidak bermakna karena:"

#. type: Bullet: '1.  '
#: _docs/FAQ_-_Client.md
msgid "I might download an app, and decide not to install it"
msgstr "Seseorang mungkin mengunduh aplikasi tetapi memutuskan untuk tidak memasangnya."

#. type: Bullet: '2.  '
#: _docs/FAQ_-_Client.md
msgid "I might download and install it, then uninstall it immediately because I don't like it"
msgstr "Seseorang mungkin mengunduh dan memasang aplikasi, lalu segera mencopotnya karena tidak menyukainya."

#. type: Bullet: '3.  '
#: _docs/FAQ_-_Client.md
msgid "I might download my app 1,000,000 times to make it look popular"
msgstr "Seseorang bahkan bisa mengunduh aplikasinya sendiri sejuta kali agar terlihat populer."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/FAQ_-_Client.md
msgid "Additionally, on a technical level, we don't even track that information. While the back-end server does track hits on each APK, these are actually served up by multiple front-end servers that cache.  This means one counted hit could represent one download, or a million.  Theoretically we could resolve this, but we are not interested enough to do so."
msgstr "Secara teknis pun, kami tidak melacak informasi tersebut. Server belakang sebenarnya mencatat *hit* pada setiap APK, tetapi semua berkas tersebut dilayani oleh beberapa server depan yang melakukan *caching*. Artinya, satu *hit* bisa berarti satu unduhan atau sejuta. Meskipun secara teori kami bisa membedakannya, kami tidak tertarik untuk melakukannya."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/FAQ_-_Client.md
msgid "Finally, even assuming any of this information were available, what does it actually mean? Are you going to use an app just because lots of others do, or ignore it because few others have discovered it yet? Is this a sensible way to decide whether something is useful to you or not? Perhaps you should just try it."
msgstr "Akhirnya, andaikan data tersebut tersedia pun, apa artinya? Apakah Anda akan menggunakan aplikasi hanya karena banyak orang lain yang menggunakannya, atau justru mengabaikannya karena belum populer? Apakah itu cara bijak untuk menentukan kegunaan aplikasi bagi Anda? Mungkin lebih baik Anda mencobanya sendiri."

#. type: Title ###
#: _docs/FAQ_-_Client.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "How can I send or setup the F-Droid app using NFC or Android Beam?"
msgstr "Bagaimana cara mengirim atau memasang aplikasi F-Droid menggunakan NFC atau Android Beam?"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/FAQ_-_Client.md
msgid "Starting with v1.20, the F-Droid client does not support these features anymore as the underlying code has been removed from the Android 14 SDK after being deprecated since Android 10. More info [here](https://www.xda-developers.com/android-beam-permanent-removal-android-14/)."
msgstr "Mulai versi 1.20, klien F-Droid tidak lagi mendukung kedua fitur tersebut, karena kode pendukungnya telah dihapus dari SDK Android 14 setelah sebelumnya dinyatakan usang sejak Android 10. Informasi lebih lanjut dapat dibaca [di sini](https://www.xda-developers.com/android-beam-permanent-removal-android-14/)."

#. type: Title ###
#: _docs/FAQ_-_Client.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "How can I send apps via Bluetooth or WiFi?"
msgstr "Bagaimana cara mengirim aplikasi melalui Bluetooth atau Wi-Fi?"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/FAQ_-_Client.md
msgid "This is done using the 'Nearby' Tab in F-Droid (previously called 'Swap').  See [here](../../tutorials/swap) for a walkthrough."
msgstr "Hal ini dilakukan melalui tab **Nearby** di F-Droid (sebelumnya disebut *Swap*). Lihat panduan selengkapnya [di sini](../../tutorials/swap)."

#. type: Title ###
#: _docs/FAQ_-_Client.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "What is the security model that F-Droid uses?"
msgstr "Apa model keamanan yang digunakan F-Droid?"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/FAQ_-_Client.md
msgid "The F-Droid security model started out with HTTPS connections and signed metadata. It has been evolving, inspired by [Debian](https://wiki.debian.org/SecureApt), [The Update Framework](https://github.com/theupdateframework/tuf/blob/develop/docs/tuf-spec.txt), and other things. You can read about details here: [Security Model](../Security_Model)."
msgstr "Model keamanan F-Droid awalnya berbasis koneksi HTTPS dan metadata yang ditandatangani. Seiring waktu, model ini berkembang dengan mengambil inspirasi dari [Debian](https://wiki.debian.org/SecureApt), [The Update Framework](https://github.com/theupdateframework/tuf/blob/develop/docs/tuf-spec.txt), dan sumber lainnya. Detail lebih lanjut bisa dibaca di halaman [Model Keamanan](../Security_Model)."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: _docs/FAQ_-_General.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "FAQ - General"
msgstr "FAQ - Umum"

#. type: Title ###
#: _docs/FAQ_-_General.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Where should I ask questions?"
msgstr "Di mana saya bisa bertanya?"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/FAQ_-_General.md
msgid "We welcome all questions and have a few places to reach out to the F-Droid community:"
msgstr "Kami menyambut segala bentuk pertanyaan, dan Anda dapat menghubungi komunitas F-Droid melalui beberapa cara berikut:"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/FAQ_-_General.md
msgid "using the [forum or chat rooms](https://f-droid.org/about/#contact)"
msgstr "Melalui [forum atau ruang obrolan](https://f-droid.org/about/#contact)."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/FAQ_-_General.md
msgid "[issue tracker](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidclient/issues) for the Android app itself (aka client)"
msgstr "[Issue Tracker](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidclient/issues) untuk aplikasi Android itu sendiri (alias klien)"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/FAQ_-_General.md
msgid "[issue tracker](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidserver/issues) for the developer tools (aka server)"
msgstr "[Pelacak isu](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidserver/issues) untuk alat pengembang (alias *server*)."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/FAQ_-_General.md
msgid "[issue tracker](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/rfp/issues) for packaging new apps"
msgstr "[Pelacak isu](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/rfp/issues) untuk permintaan pengemasan aplikasi baru."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/FAQ_-_General.md
msgid "[issue tracker](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroiddata/issues) for issues with published apps"
msgstr "[Issue Tracker](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroiddata/issues) untuk masalah yang terkait dengan aplikasi yang telah diterbitkan."

#. type: Title ###
#: _docs/FAQ_-_General.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Why isn't my favourite app included?"
msgstr "Mengapa aplikasi favorit saya tidak termasuk di F-Droid?"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/FAQ_-_General.md
msgid "Some common reasons:"
msgstr "Beberapa alasan umum:"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/FAQ_-_General.md
msgid "It's not [Free Software](https://www.gnu.org/philosophy/free-sw.html);"
msgstr "Ini bukan [Perangkat Lunak Bebas](https://www.gnu.org/philosophy/free-sw.html);"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/FAQ_-_General.md
msgid "We're trying to include it, but there's a problem with it that we're trying to resolve. Check the open [merge requests](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroiddata/-/merge_requests);"
msgstr "Kami sedang mencoba untuk menambahkannya, tetapi ada masalah yang sedang diselesaikan. Periksa daftar [permintaan *merge* yang sedang dibuka](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroiddata/-/merge_requests);"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/FAQ_-_General.md
msgid "It's on our radar, but we haven't got to it yet. Search the [issues](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/rfp/-/issues);"
msgstr "Aplikasi tersebut sudah ada di daftar rencana kami, tetapi belum sempat diproses. Coba cari di [daftar isu](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/rfp/-/issues);"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/FAQ_-_General.md
msgid "We don't know about it. See the [Inclusion Policy](../Inclusion_Policy)."
msgstr "Kami belum mengetahuinya. Lihat [Kebijakan Inklusi](../Inclusion_Policy)."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/FAQ_-_General.md
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Otherwise if you think that an app respects the Inclusion Policy and actually nobody is talking about it in the forum, you can try to be the first to do it: See the [Inclusion How-To](../Inclusion_How-To)."
msgid "Otherwise if you think that an app respects the Inclusion Policy and actually nobody is talking about it in the forum, you can try to be the first to do it: See the [Submitting to F-Droid: Quick Start Guide](../Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide)."
msgstr "Namun, jika menurut Anda aplikasi tersebut memenuhi Kebijakan Inklusi dan belum ada yang membahasnya dalam forum, Anda dapat menjadi orang pertama yang melakukannya. Lihat panduan [Cara Inklusi](../Inclusion_How-To)."

#. type: Title ###
#: _docs/FAQ_-_General.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "How can I keep track of new apps?"
msgstr "Bagaimana cara memantau aplikasi baru?"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/FAQ_-_General.md
msgid "There are several ways of keeping up with new apps that are added:"
msgstr "Ada beberapa cara untuk mengikuti pembaruan aplikasi baru yang ditambahkan:"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/FAQ_-_General.md
msgid "In the client, the \"Latest\" tab shows the latest 200 apps that were updated and that have good [descriptions and graphics](../All_About_Descriptions_Graphics_and_Screenshots)"
msgstr "Di aplikasi klien F-Droid, tab **Latest** menampilkan 200 aplikasi terbaru yang diperbarui dan memiliki [deskripsi serta grafik](../All_About_Descriptions_Graphics_and_Screenshots) yang baik."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/FAQ_-_General.md
msgid "If you don't mind a detailed and potentially noisy stream of information that also includes updates and other changes, you could subscribe to [this feed](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroiddata/commits/master.atom)"
msgstr "Jika Anda tidak keberatan menerima informasi yang lebih rinci (termasuk pembaruan dan perubahan lainnya), berlangganan [feed ini](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroiddata/commits/master.atom)."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/FAQ_-_General.md
msgid "In TWIF posts we talk about new apps and other news, you could subscribe to [this feed](https://f-droid.org/feed.xml)."
msgstr "Dalam postingan TWIF (*This Week In F-Droid*), kami membahas aplikasi baru dan berita lainnya; Anda dapat berlangganan [feed-nya di sini](https://f-droid.org/feed.xml)."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/FAQ_-_General.md
msgid "We don't yet have a dedicated and user-friendly feed you can subscribe to for new additions, but we welcome contributions to make this work better."
msgstr "Saat ini kami belum memiliki saluran khusus yang ramah pengguna untuk mengikuti aplikasi baru, tetapi kontribusi untuk mengembangkannya sangat kami harapkan."

#. type: Title ###
#: _docs/FAQ_-_General.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Is your building and signing process secure?"
msgstr "Apakah proses pembangunan dan penandatanganan F-Droid aman?"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/FAQ_-_General.md
msgid "The building and signing is done in an secure **offline** (i.e.  inaccessible from the internet) environment. Every package is built in a completely fresh isolated virtual machine environment which is discarded once the build is complete. Additionally, that build environment is completely separated from the signing environment."
msgstr "Proses build dan penandatanganan dilakukan di lingkungan **offline** yang aman (artinya tidak terhubung ke internet). Setiap paket dibangun dalam mesin virtual yang benar-benar baru dan terisolasi, lalu dihapus setelah build selesai. Selain itu, lingkungan build tersebut juga sepenuhnya dipisahkan dari lingkungan penandatanganan."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/FAQ_-_General.md
msgid "So yes, as far as we know, it's secure. However, as with everything else on the site, bear in mind this is a small community project which you are warned to use at your own risk. As with apps you get from elsewhere, including Google Play, you should exercise caution regarding the permissions they request when you install them. If in doubt, don't install."
msgstr "Jadi ya, sejauh pengetahuan kami, proses ini aman. Namun, seperti halnya semua proyek komunitas kecil lainnya, Anda menggunakannya dengan risiko sendiri. Sama seperti saat menginstal aplikasi dari tempat lain (termasuk Google Play), Anda harus tetap berhati-hati terhadap izin yang diminta aplikasi sebelum memasangnya. Jika ragu, sebaiknya jangan pasang."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/FAQ_-_General.md
msgid "For apps being built reproducible, and signed by the upstream developer, you can read more on [the dedicated page](https://f-droid.org/docs/Reproducible_Builds/#publishing-apks-with-the-upstream-developers-signature)."
msgstr "Untuk aplikasi yang mendukung **build reproducible** dan ditandatangani pengembang asli (*upstream developer*), Anda dapat membaca lebih lanjut di [halaman khusus ini](https://f-droid.org/docs/Reproducible_Builds/#publishing-apks-with-the-upstream-developers-signature)."

#. type: Title ###
#: _docs/FAQ_-_General.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Why isn't F-Droid on Google Play?"
msgstr "Mengapa F-Droid tidak ada di Google Play?"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/FAQ_-_General.md
msgid "Pick your favourite reason (both are true and valid):"
msgstr "Ada dua alasan utama (keduanya benar dan sah):"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/FAQ_-_General.md
msgid "We don't use proprietary software: Google Play is proprietary software;"
msgstr "Kami tidak menggunakan perangkat lunak proprietari — sedangkan Google Play merupakan perangkat lunak proprietari;"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/FAQ_-_General.md
msgid "F-Droid, as an app that \"competes\" with Google Play, is against their [Terms of Service (paragraph 4.5)](https://play.google.com/about/developer-distribution-agreement.html)."
msgstr "F-Droid, sebagai aplikasi yang “bersaing” dengan Google Play, melanggar [Ketentuan Layanan Google (paragraf 4.5)](https://play.google.com/about/developer-distribution-agreement.html)."

#. type: Title ###
#: _docs/FAQ_-_General.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "How can I report bugs or request features?"
msgstr "Bagaimana cara melaporkan bug atau meminta fitur baru?"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/FAQ_-_General.md
msgid "Use the [issue tracker](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidclient/issues)  or email <team@f-droid.org>. You can also discuss them in the [forum or chat rooms](https://f-droid.org/about/#contact)."
msgstr "Gunakan [pelacak isu](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidclient/issues) atau kirim email ke <team@f-droid.org>. Anda juga dapat membahasnya di [forum atau ruang obrolan](https://f-droid.org/about/#contact)."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: _docs/Feeds.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Feeds"
msgstr "Umpan (*Feeds*)"

#. type: Title ###
#: _docs/Feeds.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "News"
msgstr "Berita"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Feeds.md
msgid "Sometimes there is a newsworthy item (submissions welcome!) or client release and details get posted on the blog: <https://f-droid.org/news/>."
msgstr "Kadang ada topik menarik (kami menerima kiriman berita!) atau rilis versi klien baru yang dibahas di blog: <https://f-droid.org/news/>."

#. type: Title ###
#: _docs/Feeds.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Builds"
msgstr "Builds"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Feeds.md
