msgstr "Untuk mengetahui status build APK, kunjungi: <https://monitor.f-droid.org/builds>."

#. type: Title ###
#: _docs/Feeds.md _docs/Repository_Style_Guide.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Source Code"
msgstr "Kode Sumber"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Feeds.md
msgid "If you have an account on GitLab you can watch the F-Droid repos, or subscribe to atom feeds for them. A feed including actions from all fdroid repositories is available at <https://gitlab.com/fdroid.atom>."
msgstr "Jika Anda memiliki akun di GitLab, Anda dapat mengikuti (*watch*) repositori F-Droid atau berlangganan *atom feed*-nya. Umpan gabungan yang mencakup seluruh aktivitas dari semua repositori F-Droid tersedia di <https://gitlab.com/fdroid.atom>."

#. type: Title ###
#: _docs/Feeds.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Forums"
msgstr "Forum"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Feeds.md
msgid "You can subscribe to new [forum](https://forum.f-droid.org/) posts and threads via the following URLs:"
msgstr "Anda dapat berlangganan posting dan thread baru di [forum](https://forum.f-droid.org/) menggunakan URL berikut:"

