#. type: Title ###
#: _docs/Maintaining_the_Forum.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Upgrading"
msgstr "Proses Pembaruan (*Upgrading*)"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Maintaining_the_Forum.md
msgid "Upgrading the forum is quite simple.  Upgrades are planned to be done every one to two weeks.  If you feel like there was an important update to Discourse which should get deployed earlier, [please reach out to us]({{ site.baseurl }}/about/)."
msgstr ""
"Memperbarui forum cukup mudah. Pembaruan direncanakan setiap satu hingga dua minggu.  \n"
"Jika Anda merasa ada pembaruan penting dari Discourse yang perlu diterapkan lebih cepat, [silakan hubungi kami]({{ site.baseurl }}/about/)."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Maintaining_the_Forum.md
msgid "For administrators, this is the common way how to upgrade the forum:"
msgstr "Bagi administrator, berikut langkah umum untuk memperbarui forum:"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Maintaining_the_Forum.md
msgid "[Make a backup of the forum](https://forum.f-droid.org/admin/backups)"
msgstr "[Buat cadangan forum](https://forum.f-droid.org/admin/backups)"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Maintaining_the_Forum.md
msgid "Wait until the backup finished and download it (you'll get a link by mail)"
msgstr "Tunggu hingga proses pencadangan selesai dan unduh hasilnya (tautan unduhan akan dikirim melalui email)."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Maintaining_the_Forum.md
msgid "Go to the [upgrade section](https://forum.f-droid.org/admin/upgrade)"
msgstr "Buka [bagian pembaruan](https://forum.f-droid.org/admin/upgrade)."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Maintaining_the_Forum.md
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "* Upgrade (the different parts of) the forum, e.g. sometimes\n"
