#. type: Title ###
#: _docs/Maintaining_the_Forum.md
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "Pemecahan Masalah (*Troubleshooting*)"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Maintaining_the_Forum.md
msgid "In case something goes wrong with the forum, stay calm, you're likely not the first to be affected by this. Mostly a quick internet search gives you detailed instructions on how to fix a problem.  In the past, the following instructions were helpful:"
msgstr "Jika terjadi masalah pada forum, tetap tenang — kemungkinan besar Anda bukan orang pertama yang mengalaminya.  Biasanya, pencarian singkat di internet akan memberikan instruksi rinci untuk memperbaiki masalah tersebut.  Berikut beberapa panduan yang pernah terbukti membantu di masa lalu:"

#. type: Title ####
#: _docs/Maintaining_the_Forum.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Rebuilding the container"
msgstr "Membangun ulang container (*Rebuilding the container*)"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Maintaining_the_Forum.md
msgid "This also updates all the parts of Discourse to their newest versions.  Therefore, it's also of interest if there are many available updates in the updates section on the web interface and you want to quickly update all of them."
msgstr "Langkah ini juga memperbarui seluruh komponen Discourse ke versi terbaru. Proses ini juga berguna bila ada banyak pembaruan yang tertunda dalam antarmuka web dan Anda ingin memperbarui semuanya sekaligus."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Maintaining_the_Forum.md
msgid "Sometimes you even have to update the forum this way because a new version of _Docker manager_ got installed, causing Discourse to refuse updates through its web interface."
msgstr "Terkadang, pembaruan forum harus dilakukan dengan cara ini karena versi baru _Docker manager_ telah terinstal dan menyebabkan Discourse menolak pembaruan dari antarmuka web."

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: _docs/Maintaining_the_Forum.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"cd /var/discourse\n"
"./launcher rebuild app\n"
msgstr ""
"cd /var/discourse\n"
"./launcher rebuild app\n"

#. type: Title ####
#: _docs/Maintaining_the_Forum.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Cleaning up Docker"
msgstr "Membersihkan Docker (*Cleaning up Docker*)"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Maintaining_the_Forum.md
msgid "Docker stores copies of a lot of stuff that _could_ be used in the future, but mostly is not. From time to time it's required to clean up that stuff which sometimes results in more than 10 GB of freed space."
msgstr ""
"Docker menyimpan banyak salinan berkas yang *mungkin* digunakan di masa mendatang, namun biasanya tidak.  \n"
"Sesekali perlu dilakukan pembersihan agar sistem tetap optimal — langkah ini dapat mengosongkan ruang hingga lebih dari 10 GB."

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: _docs/Maintaining_the_Forum.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "docker system prune -a\n"
msgstr "docker system prune -a\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Maintaining_the_Forum.md
msgid "With this, the following things get deleted:"
msgstr "Proses ini akan menghapus:"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Maintaining_the_Forum.md
msgid "all stopped containers"
msgstr "Semua container yang berhenti."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Maintaining_the_Forum.md
msgid "all networks not used by at least one container"
msgstr "Semua jaringan yang tidak digunakan oleh container mana pun."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Maintaining_the_Forum.md
msgid "all images without at least one container associated to them"
msgstr "Semua *image* yang tidak terkait dengan container aktif."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Maintaining_the_Forum.md
msgid "all build cache"
msgstr "Seluruh *cache* dari proses build."

#. type: Title ###
#: _docs/Maintaining_the_Forum.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation log"
msgstr "Log Instalasi (*Installation log*)"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Maintaining_the_Forum.md
msgid "In case we need to set up the virtual machine because of some problem, you can use this instruction to do so quickly."
msgstr "Jika perlu menyiapkan ulang mesin virtual karena adanya masalah, panduan berikut dapat digunakan untuk melakukan instalasi dengan cepat."

#. type: Title ####
#: _docs/Maintaining_the_Forum.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install Discourse"
msgstr "Menginstal Discourse"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Maintaining_the_Forum.md
msgid "If you still have the old _/var/discourse_ directory available, you can simply deploy it on the new server and start it by `./launcher rebuild app`."
msgstr ""
"Jika direktori lama _/var/discourse_ masih tersedia, Anda dapat langsung menyalinnya ke server baru dan memulai ulang dengan menjalankan perintah:  \n"
"`./launcher rebuild app`"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Maintaining_the_Forum.md
msgid "Follow the [official installation guide](https://github.com/discourse/discourse/blob/main/docs/INSTALL-cloud.md)."
msgstr "Ikuti [panduan instalasi resmi](https://github.com/discourse/discourse/blob/main/docs/INSTALL-cloud.md)."

#. type: Title ####
#: _docs/Maintaining_the_Forum.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "More Info"
msgstr "Maklumat terlanjut"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Maintaining_the_Forum.md
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "You can find more info about updating and maintaining the forum as well as other admin tasks in the [F-Droid forum administrator training](https://forum.f-droid.org/t/f-droid-forum-administrator-training/5527?u=paulakreuzer) topic."
msgid "You can find more info about updating and maintaining the forum as well as other admin tasks in the [F-Droid forum administrator training](https://forum.f-droid.org/t/f-droid-forum-administrator-training/5527) topic (needs signin, limited to contributors/administrators)."
msgstr "Selengkapnya tentang pembaruan, pemeliharaan, dan tugas administratif lainnya dapat ditemukan di topik [Pelatihan Administrator Forum F-Droid](https://forum.f-droid.org/t/f-droid-forum-administrator-training/5527?u=paulakreuzer)."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: _docs/MIA_Process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "MIA Process"
msgstr "Proses MIA (*Missing In Action*)"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/MIA_Process.md
msgid "Maintainers come and go, interests and priorities change and time flies. This is true for every project and F-Droid as well. To keep the credentials and permissions in F-Droid reasonable, there is this missing in action (MIA) process."
msgstr ""
"Pemelihara datang dan pergi, minat serta prioritas bisa berubah seiring waktu — hal ini berlaku di semua proyek, termasuk F-Droid.  \n"
"Untuk menjaga kewajaran akses dan kredensial di F-Droid, diterapkanlah proses *Missing in Action (MIA)*."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/MIA_Process.md
msgid "This means we regularly check if F-Droid team members are still active, i.e.  when they last contributed, and drop those that don't respond to messages after some time. The idea is to improve F-Droid's quality, not to hunt developers."
msgstr "Ini berarti kami secara rutin memeriksa apakah anggota tim F-Droid masih aktif — misalnya, kapan terakhir kali mereka berkontribusi — dan menghapus anggota yang tidak merespons pesan setelah jangka waktu tertentu. Tujuan proses ini adalah untuk menjaga kualitas F-Droid, bukan untuk mencari-cari kesalahan pengembang."

#. type: Title ###
#: _docs/MIA_Process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "What are F-Droid team members"
msgstr "Siapa yang Disebut Anggota Tim F-Droid"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/MIA_Process.md
msgid "[Member of @fdroid group on gitlab.com](https://gitlab.com/groups/fdroid/-/group_members)"
msgstr "[Anggota grup @fdroid di gitlab.com](https://gitlab.com/groups/fdroid/-/group_members)"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/MIA_Process.md
msgid "[Contributors on forum.f-droid.org](https://forum.f-droid.org/g/contributors)"
msgstr "[Kontributor di forum.f-droid.org](https://forum.f-droid.org/g/contributors)"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/MIA_Process.md
msgid "[Reviewers on Weblate](https://hosted.weblate.org/projects/f-droid/#information)"
msgstr "[Pemeriksa di Weblate](https://hosted.weblate.org/projects/f-droid/#information)"

#. type: Title ###
#: _docs/MIA_Process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "What are contributions"
msgstr "Apa yang Dimaksud dengan Kontribusi"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/MIA_Process.md
msgid "Commits to one of the repos hosted on [Gitlab](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/)."
msgstr "*Commit* ke salah satu repositori yang di-*hosting* di [GitLab](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/)."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/MIA_Process.md
msgid "Contributions to issues on [Gitlab](https://gitlab.com/groups/fdroid/-/issues)."
msgstr "Contributions to issues on [Gitlab](https://gitlab.com/groups/fdroid/-/issues)."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/MIA_Process.md
msgid "Translations on [Weblate](https://hosted.weblate.org/projects/f-droid/)."
msgstr "Terjemahan di [Weblate](https://hosted.weblate.org/projects/f-droid/)."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/MIA_Process.md
msgid "Activity on the forum."
msgstr "Aktivitas di forum."

#. type: Title ###
#: _docs/MIA_Process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Who is MIA"
msgstr "Siapa MIA"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/MIA_Process.md
msgid "No contribution or pong to a MIA ping for at least six month."
msgstr "Tidak ada kontribusi atau tidak merespons pesan “MIA ping” selama minimal enam bulan."

#. type: Title ###
#: _docs/MIA_Process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "How are MIAs tracked"
msgstr "Bagaimana Proses MIA Dilacak"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/MIA_Process.md
msgid "For every member that is MIA, an internal issue in the [admin project](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/admin/issues/) is opened. Every ping and pong is documented there. If a number of pings don't receive a pong, the team is mentioned in the issue, to ask if someone has an other way to contact the person."
msgstr ""
"Untuk setiap anggota yang terdeteksi MIA, sebuah *issue* internal akan dibuat di [proyek admin](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/admin/issues/).  \n"
"Setiap pesan “ping” dan tanggapannya (“pong”) akan didokumentasikan di sana.  \n"
"Jika serangkaian pesan “ping” tidak mendapat respons, tim inti akan disebutkan di dalam *issue* tersebut untuk memastikan apakah ada anggota lain yang bisa menghubungi orang tersebut dengan cara lain."

#. type: Title ###
#: _docs/MIA_Process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The removal"
msgstr "Proses Penghapusan"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/MIA_Process.md
msgid "Status: First warning -> wait 16 weeks."
msgstr "Status: Peringatan pertama → tunggu 16 minggu."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/MIA_Process.md
msgid "Status: Second warning -> wait 8 weeks."
msgstr "Status: Peringatan kedua → tunggu 8 minggu."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/MIA_Process.md
msgid "Status: Final warning -> wait 4 weeks."
msgstr "Status: Peringatan terakhir → tunggu 4 minggu."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/MIA_Process.md
msgid "Afterwards, MIA accounts are removed from all F-Droid directories, including:"
msgstr "Setelah itu, akun yang MIA akan dihapus dari seluruh direktori dan layanan F-Droid, termasuk:"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/MIA_Process.md
msgid "Removed from [@fdroid group on gitlab.com](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/)"
msgstr "Dihapus dari grup [@fdroid di gitlab.com](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/)"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/MIA_Process.md
msgid "Downgraded to normal user account on <forum.f-droid.org>"
msgstr "Diturunkan menjadi akun pengguna biasa di <forum.f-droid.org>."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/MIA_Process.md
msgid "Removed as Reviewer/Maintainer from [Weblate](https://hosted.weblate.org/projects/f-droid/#information)"
msgstr "Dihapus sebagai *Reviewer/Maintainer* dari [Weblate](https://hosted.weblate.org/projects/f-droid/#information)."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/MIA_Process.md
msgid "Removed from list of [Maintainers](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/wiki/-/wikis/Maintainers)"
msgstr "Dihapus dari daftar [Maintainers](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/wiki/-/wikis/Maintainers)."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/MIA_Process.md
msgid "Removed from email lists, including team@f-droid.org."
msgstr "Dihapus dari daftar email internal, termasuk team@f-droid.org."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/MIA_Process.md
msgid "After that, the issue is closed and made public if it was set to confidential."
msgstr "Setelah seluruh proses selesai, *issue* akan ditutup dan dipublikasikan jika sebelumnya ditandai sebagai rahasia."

