#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: _docs/Running_a_Mirror.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Running a Mirror"
msgstr "Menjalankan Server Cermin (*Running a Mirror*)"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Running_a_Mirror.md
msgid "F-Droid's collection of apps and files are run on servers run by the core F-Droid contributors. Originally, this main repository was hosted only on [f-droid.org](https://f-droid.org/), but as F-Droid grew [f-droid.org](https://f-droid.org/) alone was no longer able to handle the entire load. F-Droid now supports \"mirror\" servers that replicate a full copy of the repositories. Hosting a mirror involves running an HTTPS webserver that has a full copy of the repository synchronized using `rsync`."
msgstr ""
"Koleksi aplikasi dan berkas F-Droid dijalankan di server yang dikelola oleh kontributor inti F-Droid.  \n"
"Awalnya, repositori utama ini di-host eksklusif di [f-droid.org](https://f-droid.org/), namun seiring pertumbuhan F-Droid, satu domain ini tidak lagi mampu menangani seluruh lalu lintas.  \n"
"Kini, F-Droid mendukung server “mirror” yang mereplikasi salinan penuh dari repositori utama.  \n"
"Menjalankan mirror melibatkan pengoperasian server HTTPS dengan salinan lengkap repositori yang disinkronkan menggunakan `rsync`."

#. type: Title ####
#: _docs/Running_a_Mirror.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Primary and Secondary Mirrors"
msgstr "Cermin Utama dan Sekunder (*Primary and Secondary Mirrors*)"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Running_a_Mirror.md
msgid "Whenever F-Droid has built a new index, it proactively pushes it to a selected set of mirrors, called the \"primary mirrors\". In other words, primary mirrors are updated nearly immediately. The primary mirrors are configured in ([latest list](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/web-services/-/blob/master/origin-04-mirror-push.yml)):"
msgstr ""
"Setiap kali F-Droid menghasilkan indeks baru, indeks tersebut dikirim secara proaktif ke sekelompok mirror pilihan yang disebut *primary mirrors*. \n"
"Dengan demikian, mirror utama diperbarui hampir seketika. Daftar mirror utama dapat dilihat di ([daftar terbaru](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/web-services/-/blob/master/origin-04-mirror-push.yml)):"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Running_a_Mirror.md
msgid "ftp.agdsn.de"
msgstr "ftp.agdsn.de"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Running_a_Mirror.md
msgid "ftp.lysator.liu.se"
msgstr "ftp.lysator.liu.se"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Running_a_Mirror.md
msgid "plug-mirror.rcac.purdue.edu"
msgstr "plug-mirror.rcac.purdue.edu"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Running_a_Mirror.md
msgid "The other mirrors are \"secondary mirrors\".  These mirrors should sync periodically (e.g., every 4 hours) from one of the primary mirrors. Therefore, secondary mirrors usually have a small propagation delay.  Nevertheless, note that in practice the time between any two index updates is dominated by the time to update and build the apps (in the order of days). Limiting the number of primary mirrors keeps the load on the _f-droid.org originserver_ small.  It is possible to have a \"tertiary mirror\" by syncing from a secondary mirror, which could make sense given local bandwidth constraints."
msgstr ""
"Mirror lainnya disebut *mirror sekunder* dan melakukan sinkronisasi secara periodik (misalnya setiap 4 jam) dari salah satu mirror utama.  \n"
"Oleh karena itu, mirror sekunder biasanya mengalami sedikit keterlambatan propagasi data.  \n"
"Namun dalam praktiknya, selang waktu antara dua pembaruan indeks jauh lebih dipengaruhi oleh waktu yang dibutuhkan untuk memperbarui serta membangun aplikasi (biasanya dalam hitungan hari).  \n"
"\n"
"Membatasi jumlah mirror utama membantu menjaga beban server induk (*origin server*) f-droid.org tetap rendah.  \n"
"Selain itu, dimungkinkan untuk membuat *mirror tersier* dengan melakukan sinkronisasi dari mirror sekunder — konsep ini bisa berguna jika koneksi internet lokal terbatas."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Running_a_Mirror.md
msgid "There are many mirror servers which offer an _rsync_ connection, make sure to select the mirror closest to your mirror server:"
msgstr ""
"Banyak server mirror yang menyediakan akses _rsync_.  \n"
"Pilihlah mirror yang lokasinya paling dekat dengan server Anda agar transfer data berjalan optimal."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Running_a_Mirror.md
msgid "{% include running-a-mirror-rsync.html %}"
msgstr "{% include running-a-mirror-rsync.html %}"

#. type: Title ####
#: _docs/Running_a_Mirror.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Requirements"
msgstr "Persyaratan (*Requirements*)"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Running_a_Mirror.md
msgid "There are two official F-Droid repository sections, the \"repo\" and the \"archive\". It's most important to mirror the \"repo\" since it is used much more than the \"archive\"."
msgstr ""
"Repositori resmi F-Droid terdiri atas dua bagian: “repo” dan “archive”.  \n"
"Bagian “repo” adalah yang paling penting untuk direplikasi karena lebih sering digunakan dibanding bagian “archive”."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Running_a_Mirror.md
msgid "Running a mirror mostly requires lots of disk space and bandwidth. Bandwidth requirements are reduced with each new mirror, but disk requirements grow at a [reasonable rate](https://ftp.fau.de/cgi-bin/show-ftp-stats.cgi?statstype=2&what=mirrorsize&mirrorname=fdroid&timespan=-1&graphsize=large&submit=Go%21)."
msgstr "Menjalankan server mirror terutama membutuhkan kapasitas penyimpanan besar dan bandwidth yang tinggi. Kebutuhan bandwidth menurun seiring bertambahnya jumlah mirror, tetapi kebutuhan ruang penyimpanan tetap meningkat dengan kecepatan yang dianggap [masuk akal](https://ftp.fau.de/cgi-bin/show-ftp-stats.cgi?statstype=2&what=mirrorsize&mirrorname=fdroid&timespan=-1&graphsize=large&submit=Go%21)."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Running_a_Mirror.md
msgid "In March 2019, the primary repository required just over 60GB of disk space in 24K files, and the archive required 300GB of disk space in 52K files."
msgstr "Pada Maret 2019, repositori utama membutuhkan sekitar 60GB ruang disk untuk 24.000 file, sementara bagian arsip membutuhkan 300GB untuk 52.000 file."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Running_a_Mirror.md
msgid "In February 2024, the primary repository required 450GB in 180K files, and the archive required 1.9TB in 430K files."
msgstr "Pada Februari 2024, repositori utama membutuhkan 450GB untuk 180.000 file, sedangkan arsipnya membutuhkan 1,9TB untuk 430.000 file."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Running_a_Mirror.md
msgid "In September 2025, the primary repository required 675GB in 189K files, and the archive required 3.78TB in 538K files."
msgstr "Pada September 2025, repositori utama membutuhkan 675GB untuk 189.000 file, dan arsipnya mencapai 3,78TB untuk 538.000 file."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Running_a_Mirror.md
msgid "The amount of disk space required grows with every new app release."
msgstr "Kebutuhan ruang penyimpanan akan terus meningkat seiring bertambahnya rilis aplikasi baru."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Running_a_Mirror.md
msgid "You can find current information on disk space requirements by running the following in your terminal:"
msgstr "Anda dapat mengetahui informasi terkini tentang kebutuhan ruang penyimpanan dengan menjalankan perintah berikut di terminal:"

#. type: Fenced code block (console)
#: _docs/Running_a_Mirror.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "$ rsync --dry-run --recursive --stats --human-readable ftp.fau.de::fdroid .\n"
msgstr "$ rsync --dry-run --recursive --stats --human-readable ftp.fau.de::fdroid .\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Running_a_Mirror.md
msgid "When a mirror meets the standards required by F-Droid, it can become an official mirror.  That is a mirror that the F-Droid client will use by default.  In order to become an official mirror, a mirror must have a track record of reliability, respecting privacy, and a good TLS configuration, among other considerations.  All known mirrors are tracked in the [mirror-monitor](https://fdroid.gitlab.io/mirror-monitor/).  For example, f-droid.org logs are kept for a few weeks.  Those logs are [processed](https://f-droid.org/2021/03/01/fdroid-metrics-and-clean-insights.html) to remove any personally identifiable information (PII) then keeps the minimized, safe data forever. A more common logging configuration for official mirrors is to keep the logs for 4 weeks, then delete them."
msgstr ""
"Jika sebuah mirror memenuhi standar kualitas yang ditetapkan oleh F-Droid, maka mirror tersebut dapat menjadi mirror resmi.  \n"
"Mirror resmi adalah mirror yang digunakan secara default oleh aplikasi klien F-Droid.  \n"
"\n"
"Untuk menjadi mirror resmi, server mirror harus memiliki rekam jejak yang baik dalam hal:  \n"
"- keandalan,  \n"
"- perlindungan privasi pengguna,  \n"
"- serta konfigurasi TLS yang aman.  \n"
"\n"
"Semua mirror yang diketahui tercatat dalam [monitor mirror](https://fdroid.gitlab.io/mirror-monitor/).  \n"
"Sebagai contoh, log dari *f-droid.org* disimpan selama beberapa minggu.  \n"
"Log tersebut kemudian [diproses](https://f-droid.org/2021/03/01/fdroid-metrics-and-clean-insights.html) untuk menghapus semua informasi pengenal pribadi (PII), dan hanya data teranonymisasi yang disimpan permanen.  \n"
"Konfigurasi umum untuk mirror resmi adalah menyimpan log hingga 4 minggu, kemudian menghapusnya."

#. type: Title ####
#: _docs/Running_a_Mirror.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Setup"
msgstr "Pengaturan"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Running_a_Mirror.md
msgid "This guide assumes the use of Nginx with a deb-based distribution, and mirroring the primary repository plus the archive. Please adjust accordingly if you're using alternatives or don't intend to mirror the archive. Also substitute the examples paths and domains for your own."
msgstr ""
"Panduan ini mengasumsikan penggunaan Nginx pada distribusi berbasis Debian, serta melakukan duplikasi terhadap repositori utama dan arsip.  \n"
"Sesuaikan instruksi jika Anda menggunakan perangkat lunak lain atau tidak berniat menyalin arsip.  \n"
"Pastikan juga untuk mengganti jalur dan domain contoh dengan milik Anda sendiri."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Running_a_Mirror.md
msgid "For assistance with this process, [feel free to reach out to us]({{ site.baseurl }}/about/)."
msgstr "Jika memerlukan bantuan selama proses pembuatan mirror, [silakan hubungi tim F-Droid di sini]({{ site.baseurl }}/about/)."

#. type: Title #####
#: _docs/Running_a_Mirror.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "1. Create appropriate directories"
msgstr "1. Buat direktori yang diperlukan"

#. type: Fenced code block (console)
#: _docs/Running_a_Mirror.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$ sudo mkdir -p /var/www/fdroid/fdroid/repo\n"
"$ sudo mkdir -p /var/www/fdroid/fdroid/archive\n"
"$ sudo chown -R www-data.www-data /var/www/fdroid\n"
msgstr ""
"$ sudo mkdir -p /var/www/fdroid/fdroid/repo\n"
"$ sudo mkdir -p /var/www/fdroid/fdroid/archive\n"
"$ sudo chown -R www-data.www-data /var/www/fdroid\n"

#. type: Title #####
#: _docs/Running_a_Mirror.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "2. Synchronize the repositories."
msgstr "2. Sinkronkan repositori"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Running_a_Mirror.md
msgid "These commands are best run in a terminal multiplexer (`screen`, `tmux` etc) as they will take some time to complete. With `--info=progress2` you can see the progress."
msgstr "Jalankan perintah berikut di dalam terminal multiplexer seperti `screen` atau `tmux`, karena prosesnya memerlukan waktu cukup lama. Gunakan opsi `--info=progress2` untuk memantau progres."

#. type: Fenced code block (console)
#: _docs/Running_a_Mirror.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$ sudo -u www-data -E /usr/bin/rsync -aHS  --delete --delete-delay --info=progress2 ftp.fau.de::fdroid/repo/ /var/www/fdroid/fdroid/repo/\n"
"$ sudo -u www-data -E /usr/bin/rsync -aHS  --delete --delete-delay --info=progress2 ftp.fau.de::fdroid/archive/ /var/www/fdroid/fdroid/archive/\n"
msgstr ""
"```bash\n"
"$ sudo -u www-data -E /usr/bin/rsync -aHS --delete --delete-delay --info=progress2 ftp.fau.de::fdroid/repo/ /var/www/fdroid/fdroid/repo/\n"
"$ sudo -u www-data -E /usr/bin/rsync -aHS --delete --delete-delay --info=progress2 ftp.fau.de::fdroid/archive/ /var/www/fdroid/fdroid/archive/\n"
"```\n"

#. type: Title #####
#: _docs/Running_a_Mirror.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "3. Establish a cronjob to keep the repositories up to date"
msgstr "3. Buat tugas *cron* untuk memperbarui repositori secara berkala"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Running_a_Mirror.md
msgid "Create a cronjob file in `/etc/cron.d`"
msgstr "Buat berkas tugas *cron* baru di direktori `/etc/cron.d`."

#. type: Fenced code block (console)
#: _docs/Running_a_Mirror.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "$ vi /etc/cron.d/fdroid\n"
msgstr "$ vi /etc/cron.d/fdroid\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Running_a_Mirror.md
msgid "Fill the file with entries to update the repositories. These commands will run at minute 35 past every 6th hour, you can change it to fit your needs."
msgstr ""
"Isi berkas tersebut dengan instruksi untuk memperbarui repositori.  \n"
"Contoh berikut menjalankan sinkronisasi setiap 6 jam sekali pada menit ke-35.  \n"
"Anda dapat menyesuaikannya sesuai kebutuhan."

#. type: Fenced code block
#: _docs/Running_a_Mirror.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"35 */6 * * * www-data /usr/bin/rsync -aHS  --delete --delete-delay ftp.fau.de::fdroid/repo/ /var/www/fdroid/fdroid/repo/\n"
"35 */6 * * * www-data /usr/bin/rsync -aHS  --delete --delete-delay ftp.fau.de::fdroid/archive/ /var/www/fdroid/fdroid/archive/\n"
msgstr ""
"```\n"
"35 */6 * * * www-data /usr/bin/rsync -aHS --delete --delete-delay ftp.fau.de::fdroid/repo/ /var/www/fdroid/fdroid/repo/\n"
"35 */6 * * * www-data /usr/bin/rsync -aHS --delete --delete-delay ftp.fau.de::fdroid/archive/ /var/www/fdroid/fdroid/archive/\n"
"```\n"

#. type: Title #####
#: _docs/Running_a_Mirror.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "4. Configure your webserver"
msgstr "4. Konfigurasikan server web Anda"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Running_a_Mirror.md
msgid "This is an example server block for nginx. If used, it should be copied to _/etc/nginx/sites-available/_ and symlinked to _/etc/nginx/sites-enabled_. Note that it is important that your URI be `/fdroid/repo` so that the app can automatically add your mirror."
msgstr ""
"Berikut contoh blok konfigurasi server untuk Nginx.  \n"
"Simpan berkas ini di direktori _/etc/nginx/sites-available/_ dan buat *symlink* ke _/etc/nginx/sites-enabled/_.  \n"
"Pastikan URI Anda adalah `/fdroid/repo` agar aplikasi F-Droid dapat secara otomatis menambahkan mirror Anda."

#. type: Fenced code block
#: _docs/Running_a_Mirror.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"server {\n"
"  listen [::]:80 ipv6only=off;\n"
"\n"
"  server_name fdroidmirror.example.com;\n"
"\n"
"  rewrite ^ https://$host$request_uri permanent;\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"server {\n"
"  listen [::]:443 ssl http2 ipv6only=off;\n"
"\n"
"  server_name fdroidmirror.example.com;\n"
"\n"
"  root /var/www/fdroid/;\n"
"\n"
"  ssl_certificate /etc/letsencrypt/live/fdroidmirror.example.com/fullchain.pem;\n"
"  ssl_certificate_key /etc/letsencrypt/live/fdroidmirror.example.com/privkey.pem;\n"
"\n"
"  # Insert here a TLS config from Mozilla SSL config generator https://mozilla.github.io/server-side-tls/ssl-config-generator/\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"```nginx\n"
"server {\n"
"  listen [::]:80 ipv6only=off;\n"
"\n"
"  server_name fdroidmirror.example.com;\n"
"\n"
"  rewrite ^ https://$host$request_uri permanent;\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"server {\n"
"  listen [::]:443 ssl http2 ipv6only=off;\n"
"\n"
"  server_name fdroidmirror.example.com;\n"
"\n"
"  root /var/www/fdroid/;\n"
"\n"
"  ssl_certificate /etc/letsencrypt/live/fdroidmirror.example.com/fullchain.pem;\n"
"  ssl_certificate_key /etc/letsencrypt/live/fdroidmirror.example.com/privkey.pem;\n"
"\n"
"  # Tambahkan konfigurasi TLS dari Mozilla SSL Config Generator:\n"
"  # https://mozilla.github.io/server-side-tls/ssl-config-generator/\n"
"}\n"
"```\n"

#. type: Title #####
#: _docs/Running_a_Mirror.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "5. Test that your mirror works"
msgstr "5. Uji fungsi mirror Anda"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Running_a_Mirror.md
msgid "Manually add your mirror to [F-Droid client](https://f-droid.org/packages/org.fdroid.fdroid/) to test that it works."
msgstr "Tambahkan mirror Anda secara manual ke [aplikasi klien F-Droid](https://f-droid.org/packages/org.fdroid.fdroid/) untuk memastikan bahwa mirror berfungsi dengan benar."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Running_a_Mirror.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Go to Settings -> Repositories, click the \"+\" button, and then manually enter your repository URL (don't use the QR code):\n"
"https://fdroidmirror.example.com/fdroid/repo?fingerprint=43238D512C1E5EB2D6569F4A3AFBF5523418B82E0A3ED1552770ABB9A9C9CCAB\n"
msgstr ""
"Buka menu **Settings → Repositories**, tekan tombol “+”, lalu masukkan URL repositori mirror Anda secara manual (hindari penggunaan kode QR):\n"
"https://fdroidmirror.example.com/fdroid/repo?fingerprint=43238D512C1E5EB2D6569F4A3AFBF5523418B82E0A3ED1552770ABB9A9C9CCAB\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Running_a_Mirror.md
msgid "Then disable the other mirrors except your new one, refresh the index with pull-to-refresh, and browse and install some apps!"
msgstr "Nonaktifkan semua mirror lain kecuali yang baru Anda tambahkan, lakukan *pull-to-refresh* untuk memuat ulang indeks, lalu coba jelajahi dan instal beberapa aplikasi untuk memastikan semuanya berfungsi."

#. type: Title #####
#: _docs/Running_a_Mirror.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "6. Set up a privacy policy"
msgstr "6. Siapkan kebijakan privasi"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Running_a_Mirror.md
msgid "Please include a privacy policy so that users can understand what happens with their metadata when using your mirror.  For inspiration, see:"
msgstr ""
"Sertakan kebijakan privasi agar pengguna mengetahui bagaimana metadata mereka diproses saat menggunakan mirror Anda.  \n"
"Sebagai referensi, periksa contoh kebijakan berikut:"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Running_a_Mirror.md
msgid "FAU: https://ftp.fau.de/datenschutz"
msgstr "FAU: [https://ftp.fau.de/datenschutz](https://ftp.fau.de/datenschutz)"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Running_a_Mirror.md
msgid "Lysator: https://ftp.lysator.liu.se/datahanteringspolicy.txt"
msgstr "Lysator: [https://ftp.lysator.liu.se/datahanteringspolicy.txt](https://ftp.lysator.liu.se/datahanteringspolicy.txt)"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Running_a_Mirror.md
msgid "Purdue PLUG: https://plug-mirror.rcac.purdue.edu/info.html"
msgstr "Purdue PLUG: [https://plug-mirror.rcac.purdue.edu/info.html](https://plug-mirror.rcac.purdue.edu/info.html)"

#. type: Title #####
#: _docs/Running_a_Mirror.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "7. Submit your mirror for inclusion"
msgstr "7. Ajukan mirror Anda untuk disertakan secara resmi"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Running_a_Mirror.md
msgid "Fork the [mirror monitor repo](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/mirror-monitor), add your mirror to the list in the _README_, and open a merge request."
msgstr "Fork repositori [mirror monitor](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/mirror-monitor), tambahkan mirror Anda ke daftar di _README_, lalu kirim *merge request* untuk diverifikasi dan didaftarkan sebagai mirror resmi."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Running_a_Mirror.md
msgid "Open an issue on the [admin repo](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/admin), including any pertinent information, requesting the inclusion of your mirror."
msgstr "Buka *issue* baru di [repositori admin](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/admin) dan sertakan seluruh informasi penting yang diperlukan untuk mengajukan permintaan agar mirror Anda dimasukkan ke daftar resmi."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Running_a_Mirror.md
msgid "Once the core contributor team deems your mirror trustworthy and reliable, it will be accepted into the official list."
msgstr "Begitu tim kontributor inti F-Droid menilai bahwa mirror Anda tepercaya dan andal, maka mirror tersebut akan diterima dan dimasukkan ke dalam daftar resmi."

#. type: Title ####
#: _docs/Running_a_Mirror.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Other considerations"
msgstr "Pertimbangan lainnya (*Other considerations*)"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Running_a_Mirror.md
msgid "Forward emails from cronjob failures so you know if the synchronization fails"
msgstr "Atur agar email terkirim setiap kali tugas *cronjob* gagal, agar Anda dapat segera mengetahui jika proses sinkronisasi bermasalah."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Running_a_Mirror.md
msgid "Monitor disk usage to prevent it from getting full"
msgstr "Pantau penggunaan ruang penyimpanan (disk) untuk mencegah kapasitas penuh."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Running_a_Mirror.md
msgid "Monitor your mirror so you know if it goes down (ideally keyword on _/srv/mymirror.org/htdocs/fdroid/repo/index-v1.jar_)"
msgstr "Pantau mirror Anda agar Anda tahu jika mirror tersebut down (idealnya gunakan kata kunci pada _/srv/mymirror.org/htdocs/fdroid/repo/index-v1.jar_)"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Running_a_Mirror.md
msgid "Harden your SSH server config (disable password authentication, install _fail2ban_)"
msgstr "Perkuat konfigurasi SSH server Anda — nonaktifkan autentikasi dengan kata sandi dan pasang _fail2ban_ untuk melindungi dari percobaan login berulang."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Running_a_Mirror.md
msgid "Enable unattended security upgrades (in Debian, just `apt-get install unattended-upgrades`)"
msgstr ""
"Aktifkan pembaruan keamanan otomatis.  \n"
"Pada sistem Debian, jalankan perintah:  \n"
"`apt-get install unattended-upgrades`."

#. type: Title ##
#: _docs/Running_a_Mirror.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Running a Primary Mirror (receiving syncs via push)"
msgstr "Menjalankan Mirror Utama (*Running a Primary Mirror — receiving syncs via push*)"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Running_a_Mirror.md
msgid "The preferred setup is for the F-Droid updates to be pushed to the primary mirror via _rsync_ over _ssh_ with SSH Key authentication.  This is the same as [Debian](https://www.debian.org/mirror/push_server#sshtrigger), the key difference is that there currently is no script used for the `command=\"\"`, but instead, there is a hard-coded _rsync_ command.  This really nicely restricts the security interaction to only want needs to happen (Least Authority!)."
msgstr ""
"Metode yang direkomendasikan untuk mirror utama adalah menerima pembaruan F-Droid melalui _rsync_ via _SSH_ dengan autentikasi menggunakan kunci SSH.  \n"
"Sistem ini mirip dengan yang digunakan oleh [Debian](https://www.debian.org/mirror/push_server#sshtrigger).  \n"
"Perbedaannya, F-Droid saat ini tidak menggunakan skrip untuk parameter `command=\"\"`, melainkan menggunakan perintah _rsync_ yang tertanam secara langsung.  \n"
"Pendekatan ini membatasi interaksi keamanan hanya pada fungsi yang diperlukan — sesuai prinsip *Least Authority*."

#. type: Fenced code block
#: _docs/Running_a_Mirror.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "command=\"rsync --server -logDtpre.iLsfx --log-format=X --delete --delay-updates . /srv/fdroid-mirror.at.or.at/htdocs/fdroid/\"\n"
msgstr "command=\"rsync --server -logDtpre.iLsfx --log-format=X --delete --delay-updates . /srv/fdroid-mirror.at.or.at/htdocs/fdroid/\"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Running_a_Mirror.md
msgid "The only piece of that command that is customizable is the final path.  It can be any path but it must point to the `/fdroid/` directory and must have the trailing slash.  If any of the _rsync_ options are changed, it will break the sync setup."
msgstr ""
"Satu-satunya bagian dari perintah tersebut yang dapat disesuaikan adalah jalur akhir destinasi.  \n"
"Jalurnya bisa disesuaikan, tetapi harus menunjuk ke direktori `/fdroid/` dan diakhiri dengan garis miring.  \n"
"Jika ada opsi _rsync_ yang diubah, sinkronisasi akan gagal."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Running_a_Mirror.md
msgid "As an extra precaution, there should be a user account (e.g. `fdroid`)  dedicated to receiving the _rsync_/_ssh_ connection.  It should have as little access as possible.  It should definitely not have write access to the _authorized_keys_ file, since that would allow an attacker who gains write access to add a separate key configuration line which circumvents all the restrictions listed there.  This can be done simply by doing:"
msgstr ""
"Sebagai langkah keamanan tambahan, disarankan membuat akun pengguna khusus (misalnya `fdroid`) untuk menerima koneksi _rsync_ atau _SSH_.  \n"
"Akun ini sebaiknya memiliki hak akses seminimal mungkin.  \n"
"Yang paling penting, akun ini tidak boleh memiliki izin menulis ke file `authorized_keys`, agar penyerang tidak dapat menambahkan kunci baru untuk melewati pembatasan keamanan.  \n"
"Langkah ini dapat dilakukan cukup dengan membuat akun terpisah yang digunakan khusus untuk tugas tersebut."

#. type: Fenced code block (console)
#: _docs/Running_a_Mirror.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$ sudo chown root.root /home/fdroid/.ssh /home/fdroid/.ssh/authorized_keys\n"
"$ sudo chmod 0755 /home/fdroid/.ssh\n"
"$ sudo chmod 0644 /home/fdroid/.ssh/authorized_keys\n"
msgstr ""
"$ sudo chown root.root /home/fdroid/.ssh /home/fdroid/.ssh/authorized_keys\n"
"$ sudo chmod 0755 /home/fdroid/.ssh\n"
"$ sudo chmod 0644 /home/fdroid/.ssh/authorized_keys\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: _docs/Running_on_old_Android_versions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Running on old Android versions"
msgstr "Menjalankan F-Droid di Versi Android Lama (*Running on old Android versions*)"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Running_on_old_Android_versions.md
msgid "F-Droid repos generally maintain support for old F-Droid releases for a long time.  That means that old F-Droid releases will continue to work for years. That provides a path to run F-Droid on very old Android releases. Here are the download links for installing the newest release that runs on a given Android release:"
msgstr ""
"Repositori F-Droid secara umum masih mendukung rilis F-Droid lama untuk jangka waktu panjang.  \n"
"Artinya, versi lama F-Droid tetap berfungsi selama bertahun-tahun sehingga memungkinkan pengguna Android versi lama tetap dapat menjalankannya.  \n"
"Berikut daftar versi aplikasi F-Droid terbaru yang kompatibel dengan masing-masing versi Android:"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Running_on_old_Android_versions.md
msgid "Android 6.0 (API 23) and up: [F-Droid (latest stable)]({{ site.fdroid_apk_download_url }})"
msgstr "Android 6.0 (API 23) ke atas: [F-Droid (versi stabil terbaru)]({{ site.fdroid_apk_download_url }})"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Running_on_old_Android_versions.md
msgid "First issue older Android versions encounter will be certificate related, please read and follow the steps to [install the Let’s Encrypt ISRG Root X1 certificate](https://www.stoutner.com/lets-encrypt-isrg-root-x1-and-privacy-browser/) before proceeding. Android 6 and 7 are also affected, while the latest in-client mirroring system will alleviate this and cycle through mirrors until it finds one that is still compatible, users are encouraged to add the certificate anyway as this helps other apps too."
msgstr "Masalah pertama yang dihadapi oleh versi Android yang lebih lama adalah terkait sertifikat. Silakan baca dan ikuti langkah-langkah untuk [menginstal sertifikat Let’s Encrypt ISRG Root X1](https://www.stoutner.com/lets-encrypt-isrg-root-x1-and-privacy-browser/) sebelum melanjutkan. Android 6 dan 7 juga terpengaruh, sementara sistem mirroring dalam klien terbaru akan mengatasi hal ini dengan berganti-ganti mirror hingga menemukan yang masih kompatibel. Pengguna disarankan untuk tetap menambahkan sertifikat ini, karena hal ini juga membantu aplikasi lain."

