#. type: Title ###
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Build environment"
msgstr "Lingkungan Build (*Build environment*)"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "On a laptop with Ubuntu 21.10 in February 2022, it took 2 GB of traffic and 5 GB of disk space to set up an F-Droid build environment."
msgstr "Pada laptop dengan Ubuntu 21.10 (Februari 2022), dibutuhkan sekitar 2 GB lalu lintas jaringan dan 5 GB ruang disk untuk menyiapkan lingkungan build F-Droid."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "Network requirements:"
msgstr "Persyaratan Jaringan (*Network requirements*)"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "60 MB: shallow-clone _fdroiddata_ and _fdroidserver_"
msgstr "60 MB: *shallow-clone* dari repositori _fdroiddata_ dan _fdroidserver_"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "75 MB: install _docker.io_"
msgstr "75 MB: instal _docker.io_"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "1000 MB: load the container"
msgstr "1000 MB: memuat *container*"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "800 MB: build"
msgstr "800 MB: proses *build*"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "Storage requirements:"
msgstr "Kebutuhan Penyimpanan (*Storage requirements*):"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "1000 MB: clone the repos and install _docker.io_"
msgstr "1000 MB: kloning repositori dan instalasi _docker.io_"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "4000 MB: load the container and build"
msgstr "4000 MB: memuat *container* dan melakukan *build*"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "Download and launch the latest version of the server tools container:"
msgstr "Unduh dan jalankan versi terbaru dari *container* alat server F-Droid:"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"git clone --depth=1 https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidserver ~/fdroidserver\n"
"sudo sh -c 'apt-get update &&apt-get install -y docker.io'\n"
"sudo docker run --rm -itu vagrant --entrypoint /bin/bash \\\n"
"  -v ~/fdroiddata:/build:z \\\n"
"  -v ~/fdroidserver:/home/vagrant/fdroidserver:Z \\\n"
"  registry.gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidserver:buildserver\n"
msgstr ""
"```bash\n"
"git clone --depth=1 https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidserver ~/fdroidserver\n"
"sudo sh -c 'apt-get update && apt-get install -y docker.io'\n"
"sudo docker run --rm -itu vagrant --entrypoint /bin/bash \\\n"
"  -v ~/fdroiddata:/build:z \\\n"
"  -v ~/fdroidserver:/home/vagrant/fdroidserver:Z \\\n"
"  registry.gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidserver:buildserver\n"
"```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "In the container:"
msgstr "Di dalam *container*:"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
". /etc/profile\n"
"export PATH=\"$fdroidserver:$PATH\" PYTHONPATH=\"$fdroidserver\"\n"
"export JAVA_HOME=$(java -XshowSettings:properties -version 2>&1 > /dev/null | grep 'java.home' | awk -F'=' '{print $2}' | tr -d ' ')\n"
"cd /build\n"
"fdroid readmeta\n"
"fdroid rewritemeta com.example\n"
"fdroid checkupdates --allow-dirty com.example\n"
"fdroid lint com.example\n"
"fdroid build com.example\n"
msgstr ""
". /etc/profile\n"
"export PATH=\"$fdroidserver:$PATH\" PYTHONPATH=\"$fdroidserver\"\n"
"export JAVA_HOME=$(java -XshowSettings:properties -version 2>&1 > /dev/null | grep 'java.home' | awk -F'=' '{print $2}' | tr -d ' ')\n"
"cd /build\n"
"fdroid readmeta\n"
"fdroid rewritemeta com.example\n"
"fdroid checkupdates --allow-dirty com.example\n"
"fdroid lint com.example\n"
"fdroid build com.example\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "If any command, such as `fdroid readmeta`, returns an error, edit _~/fdroiddata/metadata/com.example.yml_ accordingly and try running the command again. After a successful build, exit the container, commit your metadata file with a `New App` label, and push it to your fork:"
msgstr ""
"Jika salah satu perintah (misalnya `fdroid readmeta`) menghasilkan kesalahan, sesuaikan isi file _~/fdroiddata/metadata/com.example.yml_ dan jalankan kembali.  \n"
"\n"
"Setelah *build* berhasil, keluar dari *container*, buat *commit* untuk file metadata dengan pesan `New App`, lalu *push* ke *fork* Anda:"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"exit\n"
"cd ~/fdroiddata\n"
"git add metadata/com.example.yml\n"
"git commit -m \"New App: com.example\"\n"
"git push origin com.example\n"
msgstr ""
"```bash\n"
"exit\n"
"cd ~/fdroiddata\n"
"git add metadata/com.example.yml\n"
"git commit -m \"New App: com.example\"\n"
"git push origin com.example\n"
"```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "Create a [merge request](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroiddata/-/merge_requests)  at the _fdroiddata_ repository, selecting your _com.example_ source branch. Wait for the packagers to pick up your merge request. Please keep track if they asked any questions and reply to them as soon as possible."
msgstr ""
"Buat [*merge request*](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroiddata/-/merge_requests) ke repositori *fdroiddata*, gunakan cabang _com.example_ milik Anda sebagai sumber.  \n"
"Tunggu hingga tim *packager* memproses permintaan Anda.  \n"
"Jika ada pertanyaan atau masukan, segera berikan respons."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "You can [get help with F-Droid](../../about/#contact) via IRC, Matrix, XMPP, e-mail and some other channels."
msgstr "Anda dapat [mendapatkan bantuan tentang F-Droid](../../about/#contact) melalui IRC, Matrix, XMPP, surel, dan berbagai saluran komunikasi lainnya."

#. type: Title ##
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Application Review Process"
msgstr "Proses Peninjauan Aplikasi"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "Once the inclusion proposal is filed, the application will enter a reviewing process where F-Droid staff look into the applications source code and determine whether it fits for inclusion (and when it's not, determine all necessary steps to make it so)."
msgstr "Setelah proposal aplikasi diajukan, aplikasi tersebut akan masuk ke tahap peninjauan, di mana tim F-Droid akan memeriksa kode sumber aplikasi untuk menentukan apakah aplikasi tersebut memenuhi syarat untuk dimasukkan. Jika tidak, tim akan memberikan masukan tentang langkah-langkah yang perlu dilakukan agar aplikasi dapat diterima."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "As F-Droid is a software repository which promises users free software, a review process is for ensuring that all applications distributed from the F-Droid main repository are Free Software."
msgstr "Karena F-Droid adalah repositori perangkat lunak bebas, proses peninjauan dilakukan untuk memastikan bahwa semua aplikasi yang didistribusikan melalui repositori utama F-Droid adalah Perangkat Lunak Bebas."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "This is a nonexhaustive list of what a reviewer would do:"
msgstr "Berikut adalah daftar (tidak lengkap) dari hal-hal yang dilakukan oleh peninjau:"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "They will go to your source code repository, and look for copyright notices in license files, including _README_, to check that the proposed application is released under a [recognized Free Software and/or OSI license(s)](https://spdx.org/licenses/)."
msgstr "Meninjau repositori kode sumber Anda dan memeriksa catatan hak cipta dalam berkas lisensi atau _README_ untuk memastikan bahwa aplikasi diterbitkan di bawah [lisensi perangkat lunak bebas yang diakui atau lisensi OSI](https://spdx.org/licenses/)."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "They will look at your build script to see which build system you use, and whether F-Droid build server can handle it (Ant and Gradle are the most common and easiest ones)."
msgstr "Meninjau skrip build Anda untuk mengetahui sistem build yang digunakan dan memverifikasi apakah server build F-Droid dapat menanganinya (sistem Ant dan Gradle adalah yang paling umum dan paling mudah didukung)."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "They will try to download a copy of your source code."
msgstr "Mengunduh salinan kode sumber aplikasi Anda."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "They will look in all source code files to verify that their licenses are consistent with corresponding license/README files."
msgstr "Memeriksa seluruh berkas kode sumber untuk memastikan bahwa lisensinya konsisten dengan informasi di _README_ atau berkas lisensi."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "They will check if your application uses any pre-compiled libraries or binary blobs."
msgstr "Memeriksa apakah aplikasi Anda menggunakan pustaka prebuilt (*pre-compiled libraries*) atau berkas biner (*binary blobs*)."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "They will look at your non-source code files to identify [Non-Free resources](https://monitor.f-droid.org/anti-feature/NonFreeAssets) used in your application."
msgstr "Meninjau berkas non-kode sumber untuk mengidentifikasi [sumber daya Non-Bebas (Non-Free Assets)](https://monitor.f-droid.org/anti-feature/NonFreeAssets) yang digunakan di aplikasi."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "They will skim through the source code to see if your application uses Non-Free dependencies, shows advertisements, tracks users, promotes or depends on Non-Free or non-changeable services/applications, or does anything that is harmful or otherwise undesirable for users."
msgstr "Menelusuri kode sumber untuk memeriksa apakah aplikasi menggunakan dependensi Non-Bebas, menampilkan iklan, melacak pengguna, mempromosikan atau bergantung pada layanan Non-Bebas, atau melakukan hal-hal lain yang berpotensi merugikan pengguna."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "They will list a summary of any [_AntiFeatures_](https://monitor.f-droid.org/anti-features) in your application."
msgstr "Menyusun ringkasan [_AntiFeatures_](https://monitor.f-droid.org/anti-features) yang ditemukan dalam aplikasi Anda."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "They will try patching your application to remove usage of third-party proprietary software (if there is any)."
msgstr "Mencoba menambal aplikasi untuk menghapus penggunaan perangkat lunak proprietari pihak ketiga (jika ada)."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "They will try to determine a suitable update process for your application (e.g. by looking at how your releases relate to VCS tags and/or version information in _AndroidManifest.xml_)."
msgid "They will try to determine a suitable update process for your application (e.g. by looking at how your releases relate to VCS tags and/or version information in _AndroidManifest.xml_, build.gradle.kts, pubspec.yaml or elsewhere)."
msgstr "Menentukan proses pembaruan yang sesuai untuk aplikasi Anda, misalnya dengan memeriksa keterkaitan antara rilis, tag VCS, dan informasi versi di _AndroidManifest.xml_."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "They will try writing a suitable metadata file for your application, and add it to local F-Droid build server instance.  (`fdroid rewritemeta`, `fdroid lint` are used to ensure that metadata is well-formed)"
msgstr "Membuat berkas metadata yang sesuai untuk aplikasi Anda dan menambahkannya ke *instance* lokal server build F-Droid. Perintah seperti `fdroid rewritemeta` dan `fdroid lint` digunakan untuk memastikan metadata dibentuk dengan benar."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "They will try to build your application in an isolated environment to see if the process succeeds and yield a functional APK."
msgstr "Mencoba membangun aplikasi Anda dalam lingkungan terisolasi untuk memastikan proses build berhasil dan menghasilkan file APK yang berfungsi."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "Usually the Gitlab CI will be used, but for apps that need more resources _(storage, memory, time)_ than what the runners can offer, they might use local machines to prepare and test the metadata."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "If all went smoothly, they will add a new metadata file to their local _fdroiddata_ git repository and synchronizes the change to GitLab."
msgstr "Jika semua langkah berjalan dengan baik, mereka akan menambahkan berkas metadata baru ke repositori git lokal *fdroiddata* dan menyinkronkan perubahannya ke GitLab."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "In the case that the application failed some steps in the review, feedback will be given in the original submission queue thread where the proposal was posted."
msgstr "Jika aplikasi gagal lolos di beberapa langkah peninjauan, umpan balik akan diberikan di thread *submission queue* tempat proposal dikirimkan."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "Once the _fdroiddata_ repository is updated on GitLab, it's mostly just a matter of time before F-Droid's official build server will fetch, build, and publish your application on the main F-Droid repository."
msgstr "Setelah repositori *fdroiddata* diperbarui di GitLab, biasanya hanya tinggal menunggu sampai server build resmi F-Droid mengambil, membangun, dan memublikasikan aplikasi Anda di repositori utama F-Droid."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "You can confirm the inclusion of your application by looking at the [GitLab _fdroiddata_ revision history](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroiddata/commits/master)."
msgstr "Anda dapat memverifikasi inklusi aplikasi Anda dengan memeriksa [riwayat revisi *fdroiddata* di GitLab](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroiddata/commits/master)."

#. type: Title ##
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Build Process"
msgstr "Proses Build"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "After the application metadata is added to _fdroiddata_ GitLab repository, the next step is for the main F-Droid build server to fetch the applications source code and related components, build the application, and publish it on the main F-Droid repository."
msgstr "Setelah metadata aplikasi ditambahkan ke repositori *fdroiddata* di GitLab, langkah berikutnya adalah server build utama F-Droid mengambil kode sumber aplikasi beserta komponennya, membangun aplikasinya, dan menerbitkannya ke repositori utama F-Droid."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "This build process is done **daily**, and applications are processed in batch. As steps are done behind the scene and are mostly automatic; all the submitter needs to do is to wait for it to finish."
msgid "This build process is not running on a schedule, a cycle is started after the previous one has been published, applications are processed in batch _(you can infer the average frequency by looking at [past cycles](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/f-droid.org-transparency-log/-/commits/master))_.  As steps are done behind the scene and are mostly automatic; all the submitter needs to do is to wait for it to finish."
msgstr "Proses build ini dilakukan **setiap hari**, dan aplikasi diproses secara batch. Karena proses ini berjalan di latar belakang dan sebagian besar otomatis, pengaju hanya perlu menunggu prosesnya selesai."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "A record of a successful build process for one application is provided on the F-Droid's website page for that specific app (e.g. [see the Build Log for the F-Droid Client](https://f-droid.org/packages/org.fdroid.fdroid/#latest))."
msgstr "Catatan keberhasilan build untuk suatu aplikasi dapat dilihat di halaman website F-Droid untuk aplikasi tersebut (misalnya, [lihat Build Log untuk Klien F-Droid](https://f-droid.org/packages/org.fdroid.fdroid/#latest))."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "Apps that fail will have the log available during the build cycle on the [F-Droid Monitor - Running](https://monitor.f-droid.org/builds/running) page or, if in the previous cycle, on the [Build](https://monitor.f-droid.org/builds/build) page.  This is useful to aid in diagnosing problems when the build unexpectedly failed."
msgstr "Aplikasi yang gagal dibangun akan memiliki log yang tersedia selama siklus build di halaman [F-Droid Monitor - Running](https://monitor.f-droid.org/builds/running), atau jika pada siklus sebelumnya, di halaman [Build](https://monitor.f-droid.org/builds/build). Log ini sangat membantu untuk menganalisis penyebab kegagalan build yang tidak terduga."

#. type: Title ##
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "What to Expect"
msgstr "Apa yang Diharapkan"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "When your application metadata is approved and accepted into the _fdroiddata_ git repository on GitLab, **it won't immediately appear** in the main F-Droid repository."
msgstr "Ketika metadata aplikasi Anda disetujui dan diterima ke dalam repositori git *fdroiddata* di GitLab, **aplikasi tersebut tidak akan langsung muncul** di repositori utama F-Droid."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "Provided that your application does not have any build problems, it would takes somewhere **around 24 to 48 hours** from _fdroiddata_ merge until the application to appears in the main repository.[1](https://f-droid.org/forums/topic/how-fast-the-main-f-droid-repository-updates/)  This timing limitation is due to the APK signing part of the build process, which requires human intervention on keystore access step.[2](https://f-droid.org/forums/topic/encouraging-f-droid-participation-by-developers/#post-17868)"
msgstr ""
"Selama aplikasi Anda tidak mengalami masalah saat proses build, biasanya akan memerlukan waktu **sekitar 24 hingga 48 jam** sejak *merge* di repositori *fdroiddata* hingga aplikasi muncul di repositori utama. [¹](https://f-droid.org/forums/topic/how-fast-the-main-f-droid-repository-updates/)  \n"
"Keterlambatan ini disebabkan oleh tahap penandatanganan APK, yang membutuhkan intervensi manual untuk mengakses *keystore*. [²](https://f-droid.org/forums/topic/encouraging-f-droid-participation-by-developers/#post-17868)"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "After publishing, the apps are immediately available in the repository and any client can now update or install. The f-droid.org website takes time to generate pages for updated apps and new apps, for all the languages, so there's a slight delay until it gets updated."
msgstr ""

