#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: _docs/Take-Down_Requests.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Take-Down Requests"
msgstr "Permintaan Penghapusan (*Take-Down Requests*)"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Take-Down_Requests.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<!--\n"
"  this is very loosely inspired by:\n"
"    * https://docs.github.com/en/github/site-policy/submitting-content-removal-requests\n"
"-->\n"
msgstr ""
"<!--\n"
"  Berdasarkan pedoman:\n"
"    * https://docs.github.com/en/github/site-policy/submitting-content-removal-requests\n"
"-->\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Take-Down_Requests.md
msgid "This document covers how you may send a request to remove content or apps from the official f-droid.org repository.  Our team checks all app submissions we receive for compliance with our [inclusion policy](../Inclusion_Policy) to the best of their abilities.  Please let us know if an app in the official f-droid.org repository infringes on your rights by submitting a take-down request."
msgstr ""
"Dokumen ini menjelaskan cara mengirim permintaan penghapusan konten atau aplikasi dari repositori resmi _f-droid.org_.  \n"
"Tim kami meninjau setiap aplikasi yang diajukan agar sesuai dengan [kebijakan inklusi](../Inclusion_Policy) sejauh kemampuan kami.  \n"
"Jika Anda menemukan aplikasi di repositori resmi _f-droid.org_ yang melanggar hak cipta atau hak lainnya, silakan kirim permintaan penghapusan kepada kami."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Take-Down_Requests.md
msgid "The official f-droid.org repository is a distribution service/platform for FOSS apps and will be called downstream in the remainder of this document.  F-Droid does not hold any rights to the apps in the official f-droid.org repository other than those granted by their respective license.  The authors/copyright holders of said apps will be called upstream in the remainder of this document."
msgstr ""
"Repositori resmi _f-droid.org_ berfungsi sebagai platform distribusi untuk aplikasi FOSS dan disebut sebagai *downstream* dalam dokumen ini.  \n"
"F-Droid tidak memiliki hak kepemilikan atas aplikasi yang ada di repositori ini selain hak yang diberikan melalui lisensi masing-masing aplikasi.  \n"
"Penulis atau pemegang hak cipta aplikasi tersebut disebut sebagai *upstream* di seluruh bagian dokumen ini."

#. type: Title ##
#: _docs/Take-Down_Requests.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Submitting Take-Down Requests"
msgstr "Mengajukan Permintaan Penghapusan (*Submitting Take-Down Requests*)"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Take-Down_Requests.md
msgid "Please take some time to familiarize yourself with our policies and take-down procedure before submitting any take-down requests.  You have to make sure that requests you're submitting to us, contain all information required by our team to check the legitimacy of your claims.  If you submit an incomplete request, we will have to ask you for clarifications."
msgstr ""
"Harap luangkan waktu untuk mempelajari kebijakan serta prosedur penghapusan konten kami sebelum mengajukan permintaan *take-down*.  \n"
"Pastikan permintaan Anda memuat semua informasi yang diperlukan agar tim kami dapat memverifikasi keabsahannya.  \n"
"Jika informasi yang dikirim tidak lengkap, kami akan meminta klarifikasi tambahan."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Take-Down_Requests.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Copyright based take-down requests must at least include:\n"
"- link to the infringing content on f-droid.org\n"
"- full copyright attribution (author/artists/copyright holder, copyright date, ...)\n"
"- publishing information (publisher, publishing medium, publishing date, web\n"
"  links to postings/store-listings/e-commerce-listings/etc., ...)\n"
"- license information\n"
"- written description of the copyrighted material\n"
"- short statement about the author/artist/copyright holder/etc. which\n"
"  explains their field of expertise/field of interest/business/etc.\n"
"or a concise explanation why this information is not available.\n"
msgstr ""
"Permintaan penghapusan berbasis hak cipta harus memuat setidaknya hal-hal berikut:  \n"
"- Tautan ke konten yang dianggap melanggar di situs f-droid.org.  \n"
"- Informasi lengkap tentang hak cipta (penulis/artis/pemegang hak cipta, tahun penerbitan, dll.).  \n"
"- Informasi publikasi (penerbit, media publikasi, tanggal terbit, serta tautan ke postingan, toko daring, atau daftar e-commerce terkait).  \n"
"- Informasi lisensi.  \n"
"- Deskripsi tertulis tentang materi berhak cipta yang dimaksud.  \n"
"- Pernyataan singkat tentang penulis, artis, atau pemegang hak cipta yang menjelaskan bidang keahliannya, minat, atau jenis usahanya.  \n"
"\n"
"Jika beberapa informasi tersebut tidak tersedia, sertakan penjelasan singkat alasannya.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Take-Down_Requests.md
msgid "If your take-down request is not based on copyright, you will still need to supply ample information that allows us to check your request. (e.g. trademark registration information, inclusion policy violation information, etc.)"
msgstr ""
"Jika permintaan penghapusan Anda tidak terkait dengan pelanggaran hak cipta, tetap sertakan informasi yang cukup agar kami dapat memverifikasi permintaan tersebut.  \n"
"Contohnya: data registrasi merek dagang, bukti pelanggaran kebijakan inklusi, dan sebagainya."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Take-Down_Requests.md
msgid "Note that some apps distributed by downstream may connect to 3rd party services or rely on 3rd party software.  Downstream does not connect to these services or rely on this software, so their Terms of Service, Terms of Use or similar agreements usually do not provide an enforceable basis for take-down requests."
msgstr ""
"Perlu diketahui bahwa sejumlah aplikasi yang didistribusikan melalui *downstream* mungkin terhubung ke layanan pihak ketiga atau bergantung pada perangkat lunak pihak ketiga.  \n"
"Platform *downstream* (f-droid.org) tidak menggunakan layanan atau perangkat lunak tersebut secara langsung, sehingga *Terms of Service* atau perjanjian penggunaan dari pihak ketiga tersebut biasanya **tidak** dapat dijadikan dasar yang sah untuk permintaan penghapusan."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Take-Down_Requests.md
msgid "Also please note that f-droid.org is a volunteer-driven organization.  We prioritize take-down requests, but we can't guarantee instant responses."
msgstr ""
"Harap dicatat bahwa f-droid.org dijalankan sepenuhnya oleh sukarelawan.  \n"
"Kami memprioritaskan permintaan penghapusan, namun tidak dapat menjamin respons instan."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Take-Down_Requests.md
msgid "We accept take-down requests on our team E-Mail account.  [team@f-droid.org](mailto:team@f-droid.org). Our team will open a public issue in our issue tracker and quote your request there."
msgstr ""
"Kami menerima permintaan penghapusan melalui akun email resmi tim F-Droid: [team@f-droid.org](mailto:team@f-droid.org).  \n"
"Tim kami akan membuat *issue* publik di pelacak masalah (*issue tracker*) dan menyalin isi permintaan tersebut di sana."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Take-Down_Requests.md
msgid "Take-down requests cannot be confidential.  By submitting a take-down request you automatically grant us permission to publish your request on our web-sites and our issue trackers.  Privacy-relevant information will be redacted."
msgstr ""
"Permintaan penghapusan tidak bersifat rahasia.  \n"
"Dengan mengirimkan permintaan, Anda memberikan izin kepada kami untuk memublikasikan isi permintaan di situs web dan *issue tracker* kami.  \n"
"Informasi pribadi yang relevan akan disunting demi menjaga privasi."

#. type: Title ##
#: _docs/Take-Down_Requests.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Transparency reporting"
msgstr "Laporan Transparansi (*Transparency reporting*)"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Take-Down_Requests.md
msgid "All take-down requests we receive regarding apps on the official f-droid.org repository are transparently disclosed in our [issue tracker](https://gitlab.com/groups/fdroid/-/issues/?sort=created_date&state=all&label_name%5B%5D=Takedown%20Request)  and [merge-request tracker](https://gitlab.com/groups/fdroid/-/merge_requests?scope=all&state=all&label_name[]=Takedown%20Request)  under the `Takedown Request` label."
msgstr "Semua permintaan penghapusan yang kami terima terkait aplikasi di repositori resmi f-droid.org dilaporkan secara terbuka di [pelacak masalah](https://gitlab.com/groups/fdroid/-/issues/?sort=created_date&state=all&label_name%5B%5D=Takedown%20Request) dan [pelacak *merge request*](https://gitlab.com/groups/fdroid/-/merge_requests?scope=all&state=all&label_name[]=Takedown%20Request), di bawah label `Takedown Request`."

#. type: Title ##
#: _docs/Take-Down_Requests.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "3rd party repositories"
msgstr "Repositori pihak ketiga (*3rd party repositories*)"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Take-Down_Requests.md
msgid "Third party repositories are not under our control what so ever. If you think a 3rd party repository is violating your rights you will have to get in contact with their respective operators. Procedures described here apply exclusively to f-droid.org."
msgstr ""
"Repositori pihak ketiga sepenuhnya berada di luar kendali kami.  \n"
"Jika Anda yakin bahwa repositori pihak ketiga melanggar hak Anda, hubungi langsung pengelola repositori tersebut.  \n"
"Prosedur yang dijelaskan di sini hanya berlaku untuk f-droid.org."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: _docs/Translation_and_Localization.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Translation and Localization"
msgstr "Penerjemahan dan Lokalisasi (*Translation and Localization*)"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Translation_and_Localization.md
msgid "Every piece of F-Droid can be localized, including the Android app, the entire website, and the tools.  That means that all of the texts can be translated into any language supported by Android.  F-Droid will also use localized formats for numbers, currency, dates, etc. which happens automatically based on the language and country specified in the device's settings.  All of the F-Droid resources are available for translation on [Weblate \"components\"](https://hosted.weblate.org/projects/f-droid/)  that are each managed separately, based on technical requirements."
msgstr ""
"Seluruh komponen F-Droid dapat dilokalisasi, termasuk aplikasi Android, situs web, serta alat-alat pendukungnya.  \n"
"Artinya, semua teks dapat diterjemahkan ke bahasa apa pun yang didukung oleh Android.  \n"
"Selain itu, F-Droid otomatis menggunakan format lokal untuk angka, mata uang, dan tanggal sesuai pengaturan bahasa dan negara di perangkat pengguna.  \n"
"\n"
"Semua sumber daya F-Droid tersedia untuk diterjemahkan melalui [komponen Weblate](https://hosted.weblate.org/projects/f-droid/), yang dikelola secara terpisah berdasarkan kebutuhan teknis masing-masing proyek."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Translation_and_Localization.md
msgid "If an app's source code repo includes app descriptions, then those will be automatically included as long as they use the [supported layouts](../All_About_Descriptions_Graphics_and_Screenshots).  If there are any issues with missing translations or broken localized formats, please [file an issue](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroid-website/-/issues)  so it can be fixed."
msgstr ""
"Jika repositori sumber kode aplikasi telah menyertakan deskripsi aplikasi, maka deskripsi tersebut akan otomatis diambil selama menggunakan [struktur yang didukung](../All_About_Descriptions_Graphics_and_Screenshots).  \n"
"Apabila Anda menemukan masalah seperti terjemahan yang hilang atau format lokal yang rusak, mohon [laporkan melalui *issue tracker*](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroid-website/-/issues) agar dapat segera diperbaiki."

#. type: Title ##
#: _docs/Translation_and_Localization.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Contributing"
msgstr "Kontribusi (*Contributing*)"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Translation_and_Localization.md
msgid "Is F-Droid not in your language, or the translation is incorrect or incomplete? Get involved in the translations on [our Weblate](https://hosted.weblate.org/projects/f-droid/)."
msgstr ""
"Apakah F-Droid belum tersedia dalam bahasa Anda, atau terjemahannya masih kurang tepat atau belum lengkap?  \n"
"Anda dapat berpartisipasi dalam proses penerjemahan melalui [platform Weblate kami](https://hosted.weblate.org/projects/f-droid/)."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Translation_and_Localization.md
msgid "All translation work is done in Weblate to keep the workflow easy.  We recommend that translators use a [GitLab](https://gitlab.com) account for logging into Weblate since that same account can be used on all of the F-Droid projects on GitLab. you can find other translators on the [forum](https://forum.f-droid.org/c/translation)."
msgstr "Semua pekerjaan penerjemahan dilakukan di Weblate agar alur kerja tetap mudah. Kami merekomendasikan agar penerjemah menggunakan akun [GitLab](https://gitlab.com) untuk masuk ke Weblate karena akun yang sama dapat digunakan di semua proyek F-Droid di GitLab. Anda dapat menemukan penerjemah lain di [forum](https://forum.f-droid.org/c/translation)."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Translation_and_Localization.md
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "_Donate_<a name=\"Donate\"></a>"
msgid "<a name=\"contact\"/>\n"
msgstr "<a name=\"contact\"/>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Translation_and_Localization.md
msgid "Translators also coordinate via the dedicated chat room, which is available on Matrix at [#fdroid-translators:f-droid.org](https://matrix.to/#/#fdroid-translators:f-droid.org), by clicking [this link](https://t.me/fdroid_translators) for Telegram, IRC at [#fdroid-translators](https://webchat.oftc.net/?randomnick=1&channels=fdroid-translators&prompt=1) on OFTC, or these bridges `#fdroid-translators%irc.oftc.net@irc.jabberfr.org` / `#fdroid-translators%irc.oftc.net@irc.hmm.st` for XMPP."
msgstr "Para penerjemah juga berkoordinasi melalui ruang obrolan khusus, yang tersedia di Matrix pada [#fdroid-translators:f-droid.org](https://matrix.to/#/#fdroid-translators:f-droid.org), dengan mengeklik [tautan ini](https://t.me/fdroid_translators) untuk Telegram, IRC di [#fdroid-translators](https://webchat.oftc.net/?randomnick=1&channels=fdroid-translators&prompt=1) pada OFTC, atau jembatan-jembatan ini `#fdroid-translators%irc.oftc.net@irc.jabberfr.org` / `#fdroid-translators%irc.oftc.net@irc.hmm.st` untuk XMPP."

#. type: Title ###
#: _docs/Translation_and_Localization.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Adding a new language"
msgstr "Menambahkan Bahasa Baru (*Adding a new language*)"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Translation_and_Localization.md
msgid "First and foremost, Android must [already support](https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/base/+/master/core/res/res/values/locale_config.xml)  the specific language and locale you want to add.  We cannot work with languages that Android and the SDK do not support, the tools simply break down.  Next, if you are considering adding a country-specific variant of a language (e.g. _de-AT_), first make sure that the main language is well maintained (e.g. _de_). Your contribution might be useful to more people if you contribute to the existing version of your language rather than the country-specific variant."
msgstr ""
"Pertama-tama, Android harus [sudah mendukung](https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/base/+/master/core/res/res/values/locale_config.xml) bahasa dan lokal tertentu yang ingin Anda tambahkan.  \n"
"Kami tidak dapat bekerja dengan bahasa yang tidak didukung oleh Android dan SDK karena alatnya tidak akan berfungsi.  \n"
"\n"
"Selanjutnya, jika Anda berencana menambahkan varian bahasa yang spesifik untuk negara (misalnya _de-AT_), pastikan terlebih dahulu bahwa bahasa utamanya (_de_) sudah terpelihara dengan baik.  \n"
"Kontribusi Anda mungkin akan lebih bermanfaat bagi lebih banyak orang jika diarahkan untuk memperbaiki versi utama bahasa tersebut, bukan variannya."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Translation_and_Localization.md
msgid "For [_fdroidclient_](https://hosted.weblate.org/projects/f-droid/f-droid/), [_fdroidserver_](https://hosted.weblate.org/projects/f-droid/fdroidserver/)  and [_Repomaker_](https://hosted.weblate.org/projects/f-droid/repomaker), anyone can create a new language via Weblate.  For the rest of the translation \"components\" on Weblate, please [file an admin issue](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/admin/issues) to request a new language."
msgstr ""
"Untuk proyek [_fdroidclient_](https://hosted.weblate.org/projects/f-droid/f-droid/), [_fdroidserver_](https://hosted.weblate.org/projects/f-droid/fdroidserver/) dan [_Repomaker_](https://hosted.weblate.org/projects/f-droid/repomaker), siapa pun dapat membuat bahasa baru melalui Weblate.  \n"
"Untuk komponen terjemahan lainnya di Weblate, silakan [ajukan permintaan admin baru](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/admin/issues) untuk menambahkan bahasa."

#. type: Title ###
#: _docs/Translation_and_Localization.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "When translations are included"
msgstr "Waktu Terjemahan Disertakan (*When translations are included*)"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Translation_and_Localization.md
msgid "The translation files are included from Weblate before each release.  There are varying conditions for when the translations are included, based on the limitations of each platform."
msgstr ""
"Berkas terjemahan diambil dari Weblate sebelum setiap rilis.  \n"
"Kondisi pencantuman terjemahan berbeda-beda tergantung pada batasan masing-masing platform."

#. type: Title ####
#: _docs/Translation_and_Localization.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Android app"
msgstr "Aplikasi Android"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Translation_and_Localization.md
msgid "As a general rule, a translation must be at least 70% complete for it to be included in a final release.  For alpha releases, we try to include all translations, no matter how incomplete."
msgstr ""
"Sebagai aturan umum, suatu terjemahan harus minimal 70% selesai agar dapat disertakan dalam rilis final.  \n"
"Untuk rilis alfa, kami berusaha menyertakan seluruh terjemahan apa pun tingkat kelengkapannya."

#. type: Title ####
#: _docs/Translation_and_Localization.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "App summaries"
msgstr "Ringkasan Aplikasi (*App Summaries*)"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Translation_and_Localization.md
msgid "_f-droid.org_ makes the one line summaries for many apps [available for translation](https://hosted.weblate.org/projects/f-droid/fdroiddata/).  The goal is to make it possible to have sections where only a single language is show, like the Latest Tab or the website sidebar.  These are imported on a rolling basis, at least once a month."
msgstr ""
"Situs _f-droid.org_ menyediakan ringkasan satu baris untuk banyak aplikasi agar bisa [diterjemahkan di Weblate](https://hosted.weblate.org/projects/f-droid/fdroiddata/).  \n"
"Tujuannya adalah agar bagian tertentu seperti tab *Latest* atau bilah samping situs bisa ditampilkan dalam satu bahasa saja.  \n"
"Terjemahan ini diperbarui secara berkala, sedikitnya sekali setiap bulan."

#. type: Title ####
#: _docs/Translation_and_Localization.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "f-droid.org website"
msgstr "Situs Web f-droid.org"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Translation_and_Localization.md
msgid "For the f-droid.org website, it is a much more complicated system.  Each time the website is updated, thousands of pages must be regenerated per-locale.  Since this setup [cannot](https://gitlab.com/groups/fdroid/-/milestones/6)  support lots of languages, we have to put stricter requirements on it.  The core strings must be fully translated to be included.  They also must be maintained in order to stay included.  The documentation and tutorials are very useful to have translated.  The blog posts are the least important.  Each page must be fully translated before the translated version will be shown, otherwise, the site will show the original English."
msgstr ""
"Untuk situs web f-droid.org, sistemnya jauh lebih kompleks.  \n"
"Setiap kali situs diperbarui, ribuan halaman harus dihasilkan kembali untuk setiap lokal.  \n"
"Karena sistem ini [belum dapat](https://gitlab.com/groups/fdroid/-/milestones/6) menangani terlalu banyak bahasa, diperlukan persyaratan yang lebih ketat.  \n"
"\n"
"String inti (*core strings*) wajib diterjemahkan sepenuhnya agar bisa disertakan.  \n"
"Selain itu, terjemahan tersebut juga harus dipelihara secara aktif agar tetap dipublikasikan.  \n"
"Dokumentasi dan panduan merupakan bagian yang paling berguna untuk diterjemahkan, sementara postingan blog merupakan prioritas terendah.  \n"
"Setiap halaman harus diterjemahkan sepenuhnya; jika tidak, versi bahasa Inggris akan ditampilkan."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Translation_and_Localization.md
msgid "In order for a new language to be added to f-droid.org, it must have:"
msgstr "Agar bahasa baru dapat ditambahkan ke f-droid.org, harus memiliki:"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Translation_and_Localization.md
msgid "[Website](https://hosted.weblate.org/projects/f-droid/website) component: 100% translated"
msgstr "Komponen [Website](https://hosted.weblate.org/projects/f-droid/website) : 100% diterjemahkan"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Translation_and_Localization.md
msgid "[Website Pages](https://hosted.weblate.org/projects/f-droid/website-pages/) component: 100% translated"
msgstr "Komponen [Website Pages](https://hosted.weblate.org/projects/f-droid/website-pages/) : 100% diterjemahkan"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Translation_and_Localization.md
msgid "[Data](https://hosted.weblate.org/projects/f-droid/fdroiddata) component: at least 10% translated"
msgstr "Komponen [Data](https://hosted.weblate.org/projects/f-droid/fdroiddata) : sekurang-kurangnya 10% diterjemahkan"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Translation_and_Localization.md
msgid "A blog post announcing support for the new language with an explanation the translation team."
msgstr "Sebuah postingan blog yang mengumumkan dukungan untuk bahasa baru beserta penjelasan tentang tim penerjemahnya."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Translation_and_Localization.md
msgid "There is a [nightly build of the website](https://staging.f-droid.org)  that includes all translations on Weblate, no matter how complete they are. This lets everyone see the progress, and means we can get new languages working well before launching them."
msgstr ""
"Ada [versi *build* malam hari (nightly build)](https://staging.f-droid.org) dari situs web yang mencakup semua terjemahan di Weblate tanpa memperhitungkan tingkat kelengkapannya.  \n"
"Hal ini memungkinkan semua pihak memantau perkembangan serta memastikan bahasa baru dapat berfungsi dengan baik sebelum diluncurkan resmi."

#. type: Title ##
#: _docs/Translation_and_Localization.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The old \"Languages\" preference"
msgstr "Preferensi “Languages” Lama (*The old \"Languages\" preference*)"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Translation_and_Localization.md
msgid "There are cases where having English as the fallback language is not helpful.  For example, much of the world would prefer to fall back to Chinese, Spanish, or Russian instead of English.  On Android 6.0 and older, F-Droid provides a \"Languages\" setting inside the app so that users can switch F-Droid to a different language.  Note that this might not handle localized format properly, just the language. Android 7.0 fixed this by allowing users to specify a list of language+country \"locales\", ordered by importance to the user."
msgstr ""
"Dalam beberapa situasi, menjadikan bahasa Inggris sebagai bahasa cadangan tidaklah membantu.  \n"
"Sebagai contoh, banyak pengguna di dunia lebih memilih cadangan ke bahasa Mandarin, Spanyol, atau Rusia.  \n"
"Pada Android 6.0 ke bawah, aplikasi F-Droid memiliki opsi “Languages” yang memungkinkan pengguna mengganti bahasa tampilan aplikasi.  \n"
"\n"
"Namun, fitur ini hanya mengubah bahasa, bukan format lokal seperti tanggal atau angka.  \n"
"Android 7.0 menyempurnakan hal ini dengan memungkinkan pengguna menentukan daftar bahasa + negara (*locales*) sesuai urutan prioritasnya."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: _docs/Update_Processing.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Update Processing"
msgstr "Pemrosesan Pembaruan (*Update Processing*)"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Update_Processing.md
msgid "The F-Droid tools can automatically detect and build updates to apps and packages."
msgstr "Perangkat F-Droid dapat secara otomatis mendeteksi dan membangun pembaruan untuk aplikasi maupun paket."

#. type: Title ###
#: _docs/Update_Processing.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Detecting<a name=\"Detecting\"></a>"
msgstr "Mendeteksi<a name=\"Detecting\"></a>"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Update_Processing.md
msgid "There are various mechanisms in place for automatically detecting that updates are available for applications, with the _UpdateCheckMode_ field in the metadata determining which method is used for a particular application."
msgstr "Berbagai mekanisme tersedia untuk mendeteksi pembaruan aplikasi secara otomatis, dengan kolom _UpdateCheckMode_ dalam metadata menentukan metode yang digunakan untuk masing-masing aplikasi."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Update_Processing.md
msgid "Running the `fdroid checkupdates` command will apply this method to each application in the repository and update the _CurrentVersion_ and _CurrentVersionCode_ fields in the metadata accordingly."
msgstr "Menjalankan perintah `fdroid checkupdates` akan menerapkan metode tersebut ke setiap aplikasi dalam repositori dan memperbarui kolom _CurrentVersion_ serta _CurrentVersionCode_ pada metadata sesuai hasilnya."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Update_Processing.md
msgid "As usual, the `-p` option can be used with this, to restrict processing to a particular application."
msgstr "Seperti biasa, opsi `-p` dapat digunakan untuk membatasi pemrosesan hanya pada aplikasi tertentu."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Update_Processing.md
msgid "Note that this only updates the metadata such that we know what the current published/recommended version is. It doesn't make that version available in the repository - for that, see the next section."
msgstr ""
"Perlu diingat bahwa langkah ini hanya memperbarui metadata agar kita mengetahui versi terbaru yang dirilis atau direkomendasikan.  \n"
"Langkah ini **tidak** otomatis menambahkan versi tersebut ke dalam repositori — untuk melakukannya, silakan lihat bagian berikutnya."

#. type: Title ###
#: _docs/Update_Processing.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Adding<a name=\"Adding\"></a>"
msgstr "Menambahkan<a name=\"Adding\"></a>"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Update_Processing.md
msgid "Adding updates (i.e. new versions of applications already included in the repository) happens in two ways. The simple case is applications where the APK files are binaries, retrieved from a developer's published build. In this case, all that's required is to place the new binary in the _Repo_ directory, and the next run of `fdroid update` will pick it up."
msgstr ""
"Penambahan pembaruan (yakni versi baru dari aplikasi yang sudah ada di repositori) dapat dilakukan dalam dua cara.  \n"
"\n"
"Kasus pertama yang sederhana adalah ketika file APK berupa biner yang diambil dari hasil build resmi pengembang.  \n"
"Dalam hal ini, cukup tempatkan file biner baru ke dalam direktori _Repo_, dan jalankan `fdroid update` — alat ini akan otomatis mendeteksinya."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Update_Processing.md
msgid "For applications built from source, it is necessary to add a new `Build Version` line to the metadata file. At the very least, the version name, version code and commit will be different. It is also possible that the additional build flags will change between versions."
msgstr ""
"Untuk aplikasi yang dibangun dari kode sumber, perlu menambahkan baris `Build Version` baru ke file metadata.  \n"
"Setidaknya, nama versi, kode versi, dan *commit* akan berbeda.  \n"
"Selain itu, mungkin juga ada perubahan pada parameter atau flag build antarversi."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Update_Processing.md
msgid "For processing multiple updates in the metadata at once, it can be useful to run `fdroid update --interactive`. This will check all the applications in the repository, and where updates are required you will be prompted to \\[E\\]dit the metadata, \\[I\\]gnore the update, or \\[Q\\]uit altogether."
msgstr ""
"Untuk memproses beberapa pembaruan sekaligus di metadata, Anda dapat menjalankan `fdroid update --interactive`.  \n"
"Perintah ini akan memeriksa semua aplikasi dalam repositori, dan untuk setiap pembaruan, Anda akan mendapatkan opsi untuk \\[E\\]mengedit metadata, \\[I\\]mengabaikan pembaruan, atau \\[Q\\]keluar dari proses."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: _docs/Verification_Server.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Verification Server"
msgstr "Server Verifikasi (*Verification Server*)"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Verification_Server.md
msgid "The idea of a [verification server](https://verification.f-droid.org)  is to automatically reproduce official releases published by f-droid.org (or any other server).  Another name for this is a [rebuilder](https://reproducible-builds.org/tools/#rebuilder-backends).  This process ensures that everything in the release APK came from the source code, and nothing was inserted or included during the build process.  This is also useful for verifying that the build process is not including proprietary libraries."
msgstr ""
"Konsep [server verifikasi](https://verification.f-droid.org) adalah untuk membangun otomatis ulang rilis resmi yang diterbitkan oleh f-droid.org (atau server lain).  \n"
"Konsep ini juga dikenal sebagai [*rebuilder*](https://reproducible-builds.org/tools/#rebuilder-backends).  \n"
"\n"
"Tujuannya ialah memastikan bahwa seluruh isi dalam file APK hasil rilis benar-benar berasal dari kode sumber, dan tidak ada elemen asing yang disisipkan selama proses build.  \n"
"Selain itu, metode ini juga membantu memastikan bahwa proses build tidak menyertakan pustaka berpemilik (*proprietary libraries*)."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Verification_Server.md
msgid "The ultimate goal is a simple installation that any third party can make, that will continuously check for new published packages, make its own builds, and confirm that the binaries match exactly. There are many issues to resolve to get to this final destination, but the basic concept is already tested and working. (see the 'fdroid verify' command)."
msgstr ""
"Tujuan akhirnya adalah menciptakan sistem instalasi sederhana yang dapat dijalankan pihak ketiga untuk terus memeriksa pembaruan paket, melakukan *build* mandiri, dan memastikan bahwa file biner yang dihasilkan identik.  \n"
"Meskipun masih ada sejumlah tantangan teknis untuk mencapainya, konsep dasarnya sudah berfungsi dan dapat diuji menggunakan perintah `fdroid verify`."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Verification_Server.md
msgid "The output of multiple verification servers would then be available to the F-Droid client. The idea would be to configure the client such that it does not trust a binary until multiple verification servers are in agreement that it correct."
msgstr ""
"Hasil dari beberapa server verifikasi nantinya dapat diakses oleh klien F-Droid.  \n"
"Gagasannya adalah konfigurasi klien hanya akan mempercayai biner jika beberapa server verifikasi menyatakan hasil yang sama — dengan kata lain, semua sepakat bahwa file tersebut benar dan identik."

#. type: Title ##
#: _docs/Verification_Server.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Verification based on APK signature"
msgstr "Verifikasi Berdasarkan Tanda Tangan APK (*Verification based on APK signature*)"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Verification_Server.md
msgid "The verification process [currently works](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/buildbot/-/blob/988fc009/master/master.cfg#L155)  by building a new unsigned APK, then [copying](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidserver/-/blob/2.4.0/fdroidserver/common.py#L3773)  the APK signature from the existing APK into the newly built unsigned APK.  If the APK signature verifies, then the APK has been reproduced, and is marked as verified.  If not, a [diffoscope](https://diffoscope.org) log is generated to show what the differences are between the two builds. The verification server needs no signing capability, just building."
msgstr ""
"Proses verifikasi [saat ini dilakukan](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/buildbot/-/blob/988fc009/master/master.cfg#L155) dengan membangun ulang APK tanpa tanda tangan, lalu [menyalin](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidserver/-/blob/2.4.0/fdroidserver/common.py#L3773) tanda tangan dari APK resmi ke dalam APK yang baru dibangun.  \n"
"\n"
"Jika tanda tangan berhasil diverifikasi, berarti APK berhasil direproduksi dan ditandai “terverifikasi”.  \n"
"Namun, jika tidak cocok, akan dibuat log dari [diffoscope](https://diffoscope.org) yang menunjukkan perbedaan antara dua hasil build.  \n"
"Server verifikasi tidak memerlukan kemampuan menandatangani file — cukup kemampuan untuk membangun (*build*) saja."

#. type: Title ##
#: _docs/Verification_Server.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Setting one up"
msgstr "Langkah Penyiapan (*Setting one up*)"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Verification_Server.md
msgid "The verification server is managed via an [Ansible Playbook](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroid-verification-server) which is installed on a server running Debian/stable that is configured to run containers with rootless Podman. This is what runs <https://verification.f-droid.org>, but it is still pretty raw, so expect some tinkering.  We welcome contributions.  It is a goal that this setup become generic enough that the maintainer of any F-Droid compatible repository can use this setup as a rebuilder."
msgstr ""
"Server verifikasi dikelola menggunakan [Ansible Playbook](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroid-verification-server), dan diinstal pada server berbasis Debian/stable yang dikonfigurasi untuk menjalankan kontainer menggunakan Podman tanpa hak *root* (*rootless*).  \n"
"Inilah sistem yang menjalankan <https://verification.f-droid.org>, meskipun masih dalam tahap awal, jadi kemungkinan membutuhkan beberapa penyesuaian.  \n"
"\n"
"Kontribusi sangat disambut, dan tujuannya adalah agar sistem ini cukup generik untuk digunakan oleh pengelola repositori apa pun yang kompatibel dengan F-Droid sebagai *rebuilder*."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: _docs/Verifying_Downloaded_APK.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Verifying downloaded F-Droid.apk"
msgstr "Memverifikasi File *F-Droid.apk* (*Verifying downloaded F-Droid.apk*)"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Verifying_Downloaded_APK.md
msgid "Some details on this can be found in our documentation at [Release Channels and Signing Keys](../Release_Channels_and_Signing_Keys). To make it easier to understand for non-devs, here are the steps in short:"
msgstr ""
"Detailnya dapat ditemukan di dokumentasi kami, [Saluran Rilis dan Kunci Tanda Tangan](../Release_Channels_and_Signing_Keys).  \n"
"Untuk memudahkan bagi pengguna non-developer, berikut langkah singkatnya:"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Verifying_Downloaded_APK.md
msgid "download [https://f-droid.org/F-Droid.apk.asc](https://f-droid.org/F-Droid.apk.asc) and [https://f-droid.org/F-Droid.apk](https://f-droid.org/F-Droid.apk)"
msgstr ""
"Unduh file berikut:  \n"
"- [https://f-droid.org/F-Droid.apk.asc](https://f-droid.org/F-Droid.apk.asc)  \n"
"- [https://f-droid.org/F-Droid.apk](https://f-droid.org/F-Droid.apk)"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Verifying_Downloaded_APK.md
msgid "load the public key for `admin@f-droid.org`"
msgstr "Muat kunci publik untuk `admin@f-droid.org`."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Verifying_Downloaded_APK.md
msgid "compare the fingerprint with what the documentation mentioned above states"
msgstr "Bandingkan *fingerprint* kunci dengan yang tercantum dalam dokumentasi di atas."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Verifying_Downloaded_APK.md
msgid "verify the file"
msgstr "Lakukan proses verifikasi file."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Verifying_Downloaded_APK.md
msgid "On Linux, this is what it would look like:"
msgstr "Contoh perintah di Linux:"

#. type: Fenced code block
#: _docs/Verifying_Downloaded_APK.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# download the files\n"
"wget -q https://f-droid.org/F-Droid.apk.asc\n"
"wget -q https://f-droid.org/F-Droid.apk\n"
"# load the public key\n"
"gpg --keyserver keyserver.ubuntu.com --recv-key 37D2C98789D8311948394E3E41E7044E1DBA2E89\n"
"# verify the file\n"
"gpg --verify F-Droid.apk.asc F-Droid.apk\n"
msgstr ""
"```bash\n"
"# Unduh berkas\n"
"wget -q https://f-droid.org/F-Droid.apk.asc\n"
"wget -q https://f-droid.org/F-Droid.apk\n"
"# Muat kunci publik\n"
"gpg --keyserver keyserver.ubuntu.com --recv-key 37D2C98789D8311948394E3E41E7044E1DBA2E89\n"
"# Verifikasi file\n"
"gpg --verify F-Droid.apk.asc F-Droid.apk\n"
"```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Verifying_Downloaded_APK.md
msgid "The expected output of the last command should look like:"
msgstr "Keluaran yang diharapkan dari perintah terakhir akan terlihat seperti berikut:"

#. type: Fenced code block
#: _docs/Verifying_Downloaded_APK.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"gpg: Signature made Mon 09 Aug 2021 11:17:55 PM CEST\n"
"gpg:                using RSA key 802A9799016112346E1FEFF47A029E54DD5DCE7A\n"
"gpg: Good signature from \"F-Droid <admin@f-droid.org>\" [unknown]\n"
"gpg: WARNING: This key is not certified with a trusted signature!\n"
"gpg:          There is no indication that the signature belongs to the owner.\n"
"Primary key fingerprint: 37D2 C987 89D8 3119 4839  4E3E 41E7 044E 1DBA 2E89\n"
"     Subkey fingerprint: 802A 9799 0161 1234 6E1F  EFF4 7A02 9E54 DD5D CE7A\n"
msgstr ""
"```text\n"
"gpg: Signature made Mon 09 Aug 2021 11:17:55 PM CEST\n"
"gpg:                using RSA key 802A9799016112346E1FEFF47A029E54DD5DCE7A\n"
"gpg: Good signature from \"F-Droid <admin@f-droid.org>\" [unknown]\n"
"gpg: WARNING: This key is not certified with a trusted signature!\n"
"gpg:          There is no indication that the signature belongs to the owner.\n"
"Primary key fingerprint: 37D2 C987 89D8 3119 4839  4E3E 41E7 044E 1DBA 2E89\n"
"     Subkey fingerprint: 802A 9799 0161 1234 6E1F  EFF4 7A02 9E54 DD5D CE7A\n"
"```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Verifying_Downloaded_APK.md
msgid "The date will vary as the client APK is updated, it's not an issue if it is newer. The warning about the key not being certified with a trusted signature can be ignored. The important part is the indication of a good signature and that it has the same fingerprint that was used to download the key:"
msgstr ""
"Tanggal dapat berbeda tergantung versi terbaru dari APK klien, dan hal tersebut bukan masalah jika lebih baru.  \n"
"Peringatan mengenai kunci yang tidak tersertifikasi (*not certified with a trusted signature*) dapat diabaikan.  \n"
"Yang paling penting adalah adanya indikasi tanda tangan valid (\"Good signature\") serta *fingerprint* yang sesuai dengan kunci yang digunakan saat mengunduh."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Verifying_Downloaded_APK.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "    37D2 C987 89D8 3119 4839 4E3E 41E7 044E 1DBA 2E89\n"
msgstr "    37D2 C987 89D8 3119 4839 4E3E 41E7 044E 1DBA 2E89\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: _docs/Whitelabel_Builds.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Whitelabel Builds"
msgstr "Build *Whitelabel*"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Whitelabel_Builds.md
msgid "F-Droid can be rebranded and embedded in Android ROMs, building upon F-Droid as the \"white-label\" version. This is a basic introduction for how to do that. For this, [\"_gradle_ flavors\"](https://developer.android.com/studio/build/build-variants.html)  are used for building rebranded, configured versions of F-Droid."
msgstr ""
"F-Droid dapat dipasangkan atau diperbarui citranya untuk digunakan dalam ROM Android sebagai versi *white-label*.  \n"
"Berikut pengenalan dasar tentang proses tersebut.  \n"
"\n"
"Untuk keperluan ini digunakan fitur [\"_gradle_ flavors\"](https://developer.android.com/studio/build/build-variants.html) untuk membangun versi F-Droid yang telah dikustomisasi dan dikonfigurasi."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Whitelabel_Builds.md
msgid "Starting in *app/build.gradle*, set the package names and create a _flavorDimension_ and _productFlavors_:"
msgstr "Mulai dari file *app/build.gradle*, tetapkan nama paket dan buat bagian _flavorDimension_ serta _productFlavors_:"

#. type: Fenced code block (gradle)
#: _docs/Whitelabel_Builds.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"def fullApplicationId = \"com.mycompany.full\"\n"
"def basicApplicationId = \"com.mycompany.basic\"\n"
"// yes, this actually needs both quotes https://stackoverflow.com/a/41391841\n"
"def privilegedExtensionApplicationId = '\"com.mycompany.privileged\"'\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"[snip]\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"android {\n"
"    flavorDimensions \"base\", \"mycompany\"\n"
"    productFlavors {\n"
"       mycompany {\n"
"           dimension \"mycompany\"\n"
"       }\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"```groovy\n"
"def fullApplicationId = \"com.mycompany.full\"\n"
"def basicApplicationId = \"com.mycompany.basic\"\n"
"// ya, tanda kutip ganda ini memang diperlukan\n"
"// https://stackoverflow.com/a/41391841\n"
"def privilegedExtensionApplicationId = '\"com.mycompany.privileged\"'\n"
"\n"
"[snip]\n"
"\n"
"android {\n"
"    flavorDimensions \"base\", \"mycompany\"\n"
"    productFlavors {\n"
"       mycompany {\n"
"           dimension \"mycompany\"\n"
"       }\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
"```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Whitelabel_Builds.md
msgid "Then *gradle* will automatically look at whole set of folders for custom versions of files:"
msgstr "Setelah itu, *Gradle* akan otomatis mencari seluruh kumpulan folder yang berisi versi kustom dari setiap file berikut:"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Whitelabel_Builds.md
msgid "Java sources: _app/src/mycompany/java_"
msgstr "Kode sumber Java: _app/src/mycompany/java_"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Whitelabel_Builds.md
msgid "Manifest file: _app/src/mycompany/AndroidManifest.xml_"
msgstr "File *Manifest*: _app/src/mycompany/AndroidManifest.xml_"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Whitelabel_Builds.md
msgid "Android resources: _app/src/mycompany/res_"
msgstr "Sumber daya Android: _app/src/mycompany/res_"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Whitelabel_Builds.md
msgid "Assets: _app/src/mycompany/assets_"
msgstr "Aset: _app/src/mycompany/assets_"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Whitelabel_Builds.md
msgid "There cannot be duplicate Java classes, but any extensions can be managed there. For anything in _res/_, i.e. _strings.xml_ or drawable resources, the files in _app/src/mycompany/res_ will take precedence over the default F-Droid ones. For example, override the app icon by providing _app/src/mycompany/res/drawable/ic\\_launcher.xml_."
msgstr ""
"Tidak boleh ada kelas Java yang duplikat, namun semua ekstensi tambahan bisa dikelola di sini.  \n"
"Untuk semua file dalam _res/_ (misalnya _strings.xml_ atau berkas gambar), file di _app/src/mycompany/res_ akan mengungguli file bawaan F-Droid.  \n"
"\n"
"Sebagai contoh, untuk mengganti ikon aplikasi, buat file _app/src/mycompany/res/drawable/ic_launcher.xml_."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Whitelabel_Builds.md
msgid "To specify a custom set of app repositories, provide _app/src/mycompany/res/values/default\\_repos.xml_. The format of that file is a String array, with sets of 8 elements per repo. For example, here's the Guardian Project repo config enabled by default with push request always accepted by the client:"
msgstr ""
"Untuk menetapkan daftar repositori aplikasi khusus, buat file _app/src/mycompany/res/values/default_repos.xml_.  \n"
"Format file ini berupa *String array* dengan kelompok berisi 8 elemen per repositori.  \n"
"\n"
"Berikut contoh konfigurasi repositori *Guardian Project* yang diaktifkan secara default, dengan permintaan *push* selalu diterima oleh klien:"

#. type: Fenced code block (xml)
#: _docs/Whitelabel_Builds.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" <!-- name -->\n"
" <item>Guardian Project</item>\n"
" <!-- address -->\n"
" <item>https://guardianproject.info/fdroid/repo</item>\n"
" <!-- description -->\n"
" <item>\n"
"   The official app repository of The Guardian\n"
"   Project. Applications in this repository are official\n"
"   binaries build by the original application developers and\n"
"   signed by the same key as the APKs that are released in the\n"
"   Google Play store.\n"
" </item>\n"
" <!-- version -->\n"
" <item>13</item>\n"
" <!-- enabled -->\n"
" <item>1</item>\n"
" <!-- priority -->\n"
" <item>10</item>\n"
" <!-- push requests: ignore, prompt, always -->\n"
" <item>always</item>\n"
" <!-- pubkey -->\n"
" <item>\n"
"   \n"
" </item>\n"
msgstr ""
" <!-- name -->\n"
